(4210345, 604685, 19982, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I''ve seen this one somewhere before.  But I *still* love it!<br/> <br/>For what it''s worth, I love, love, love long hair, and you have beautiful hair, but I still would have cropped it closer to the inside edge of the hair line just to put your face and mic on a thirds line.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Hmmm... I''ve seen this one somewhere before.  But I *still* love it! For what it''s worth, I love, love, love long hair, and you have beautiful hair, but I still would have cropped it closer to the inside edge of the hair line just to put your face and mic on a thirds line. Keep up the good work.', '2007-11-01 00:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
