(4210395, 607010, 19982, '<td valign="top">In this case, I think color may have been a better choice.  Her face and upper body works well in B&amp;W.  But from there down, things start to get a little too messy/complex in B&amp;W and I''m thinking if I could see color it would help me separate what I''m looking at.</td>', 'In this case, I think color may have been a better choice.  Her face and upper body works well in B&W.  But from there down, things start to get a little too messy/complex in B&W and I''m thinking if I could see color it would help me separate what I''m looking at.', '2007-11-01 00:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
