(4210464, 597907, 8522, '<td valign="top">A competent shot, but needs something extra to lift it above every other ''buildings reflected in windows'' shot. Nice blues. Not sure about the tree at the bottom left. Not quite sure what you''re trying to communicate with this photo... perhaps the flag needs more prominence if you want it to be the focus.</td>', 'A competent shot, but needs something extra to lift it above every other ''buildings reflected in windows'' shot. Nice blues. Not sure about the tree at the bottom left. Not quite sure what you''re trying to communicate with this photo... perhaps the flag needs more prominence if you want it to be the focus.', '2007-11-01 00:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
