(4210610, 606318, 8522, '<td valign="top">For real sense of speed, you need a background with much more blur. This particluar background is not too photogenic. Wheels also need more blur. Slower shutter speed the next time! Not sure I like the back of the car cropped, don''t like the helmet almost smack in the middle of the shot, composition here feels like an afterthought.</td>', 'For real sense of speed, you need a background with much more blur. This particluar background is not too photogenic. Wheels also need more blur. Slower shutter speed the next time! Not sure I like the back of the car cropped, don''t like the helmet almost smack in the middle of the shot, composition here feels like an afterthought.', '2007-11-01 01:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
