(4210689, 604648, 64670, '<td valign="top">A case of too much and not enough for me.  Firstly the border is too much.  I''m not sure if you want my eye to commence on the water, but it''s too ''little'' to be of real interest.  The blown out sky is a real disappointment.  In addition I''m guessing that there was either no tripod used or the camera did not lock focus on anything.</td>', 'A case of too much and not enough for me.  Firstly the border is too much.  I''m not sure if you want my eye to commence on the water, but it''s too ''little'' to be of real interest.  The blown out sky is a real disappointment.  In addition I''m guessing that there was either no tripod used or the camera did not lock focus on anything.', '2007-11-01 01:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
