(4210756, 607368, 64670, '<td valign="top">Just BRILLIANT perspective and clarity - wonderful.</td>', 'Just BRILLIANT perspective and clarity - wonderful.', '2007-11-01 02:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210757, 606150, 36832, '<td valign="top">Ok, so you''re going to get the blue, and I just love everything about this photo.  :)  I hope you post the original and tell us your techniques!!!</td>', 'Ok, so you''re going to get the blue, and I just love everything about this photo.  :)  I hope you post the original and tell us your techniques!!!', '2007-11-01 02:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210758, 600807, 78445, '<td valign="top">Ha Ha. Good point of view</td>', 'Ha Ha. Good point of view', '2007-11-01 02:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210773, 607310, 64670, '<td valign="top">Awesome cars and location.  Unfortunately it''s come across and very flat.  The conversion my not have been the best or the lighting at the time of day.  The flat sky doesn''t help either.<br/> <br/>Maybe it would have worked better to move about a bit and take another pespective that had less sky and more car, maybe a from behind shot or up and over the front grill?</td>', 'Awesome cars and location.  Unfortunately it''s come across and very flat.  The conversion my not have been the best or the lighting at the time of day.  The flat sky doesn''t help either. Maybe it would have worked better to move about a bit and take another pespective that had less sky and more car, maybe a from behind shot or up and over the front grill?', '2007-11-01 02:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210776, 606991, 78445, '<td valign="top">Great idea!!! A flower taken on a totally different angle!!!</td>', 'Great idea!!! A flower taken on a totally different angle!!!', '2007-11-01 02:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210777, 607171, 64670, '<td valign="top">A snapshot, but doesn''t come across as a serious shot aimed at a competition of this number.<br/> <br/>Perhaps it may have worked to move the boy under a tree or shade of some sort to reduce the harsh lighting and also to remove the 1/2 person and other person and distractions in the background.</td>', 'A snapshot, but doesn''t come across as a serious shot aimed at a competition of this number. Perhaps it may have worked to move the boy under a tree or shade of some sort to reduce the harsh lighting and also to remove the 1/2 person and other person and distractions in the background.', '2007-11-01 02:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210779, 606847, 64670, '<td valign="top">Just LOVELY.  Excellent model and lighting.  Wonderful!</td>', 'Just LOVELY.  Excellent model and lighting.  Wonderful!', '2007-11-01 02:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210780, 607316, 45631, '<td valign="top">A very pretty subject but IMO the hands in the hair hasn''t worked well here.</td>', 'A very pretty subject but IMO the hands in the hair hasn''t worked well here.', '2007-11-01 02:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210785, 607260, 64670, '<td valign="top">I think selective desat works best when the focus is on one item.  All the reds selected flatten the image somewhat.  The Greyscale is very flat too.</td>', 'I think selective desat works best when the focus is on one item.  All the reds selected flatten the image somewhat.  The Greyscale is very flat too.', '2007-11-01 02:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210788, 605685, 64670, '<td valign="top">Love the clarity.  I think for balance in my mind I''d have wanted the stump and the cloud opening to be diagonally opposite not as they are.</td>', 'Love the clarity.  I think for balance in my mind I''d have wanted the stump and the cloud opening to be diagonally opposite not as they are.', '2007-11-01 02:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210791, 607470, 64670, '<td valign="top">The image suffers from lack of clarity due to lack of tripod.  The choice of selective desat is strange to me, because I can''t read it and have no way of knowing why you thought it was important enough to pick out.</td>', 'The image suffers from lack of clarity due to lack of tripod.  The choice of selective desat is strange to me, because I can''t read it and have no way of knowing why you thought it was important enough to pick out.', '2007-11-01 02:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210793, 602492, 64670, '<td valign="top">Holy COW!  This is AMAZING!  SO clear and beautifully perspective.<br/> <br/>My only thought was it is a touch ''too'' red.</td>', 'Holy COW!  This is AMAZING!  SO clear and beautifully perspective. My only thought was it is a touch ''too'' red.', '2007-11-01 02:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210794, 601824, 64670, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  Just too harsh lighting for my eyes.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  Just too harsh lighting for my eyes.', '2007-11-01 02:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210795, 605362, 64670, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and shade exercise.</td>', 'Lovely light and shade exercise.', '2007-11-01 02:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210796, 605034, 64670, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, clear and lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful, clear and lovely.', '2007-11-01 02:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210797, 606603, 64670, '<td valign="top">Oh WOW - what an amazing subject!<br/> <br/>I think his face is delicious, just wish it was a bit sharper.</td>', 'Oh WOW - what an amazing subject! I think his face is delicious, just wish it was a bit sharper.', '2007-11-01 02:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210798, 606762, 64670, '<td valign="top">Lighting is way to harsh for this to be a successful image.  Because of the the sky is flat the shade and light is too extreme and we''ve lost the eyes almost entirely which we usually use to ''reach us'' in a story.</td>', 'Lighting is way to harsh for this to be a successful image.  Because of the the sky is flat the shade and light is too extreme and we''ve lost the eyes almost entirely which we usually use to ''reach us'' in a story.', '2007-11-01 02:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210800, 605273, 64670, '<td valign="top">Love the gentleness of the grasses.  Shame about the light on the animal, bit too harsh around the face and tail.</td>', 'Love the gentleness of the grasses.  Shame about the light on the animal, bit too harsh around the face and tail.', '2007-11-01 02:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210804, 607040, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great reflection. Lovely colours.</td>', 'Great reflection. Lovely colours.', '2007-11-01 02:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210805, 607239, 64670, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful colours.  Good model, but the eyes are lacking.  A reflector would have done wonders here, if you don''t have one, you might benefit from trying the ''Pimp those Eyes'' tutorial by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=15266" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">idnic</a>.<br/> <br/>Slight dodge above the right eye would also have stopped the eyebrow looking so extreme.</td>', 'Just wonderful colours.  Good model, but the eyes are lacking.  A reflector would have done wonders here, if you don''t have one, you might benefit from trying the ''Pimp those Eyes'' tutorial by  idnic. Slight dodge above the right eye would also have stopped the eyebrow looking so extreme.', '2007-11-01 02:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210806, 607451, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great waterfall, lovely gentle flow with shutter speed.  The rest is a bit  flat.</td>', 'Great waterfall, lovely gentle flow with shutter speed.  The rest is a bit  flat.', '2007-11-01 02:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210818, 607157, 34938, '<td valign="top">wow...stunning hues in the sky...looks surreal 9</td>', 'wow...stunning hues in the sky...looks surreal 9', '2007-11-01 02:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210819, 607174, 34938, '<td valign="top">beautiful mist...I am of two minds whether there needed to be people in the shot...</td>', 'beautiful mist...I am of two minds whether there needed to be people in the shot...', '2007-11-01 02:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210820, 607368, 34938, '<td valign="top">great colours and nice dof...great abstract</td>', 'great colours and nice dof...great abstract', '2007-11-01 02:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4210821, 606543, 71459, '<td valign="top">Shadows on her left side of her face (camera right) is a little funky, but isn''t terrible... cool eyes!</td>', 'Shadows on her left side of her face (camera right) is a little funky, but isn''t terrible... cool eyes!', '2007-11-01 02:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
