(4211310, 601866, 34938, '<td valign="top">OK, let me see...it looks like you used Neat Image, or some noise reduction. It has really taken away the grain of the wood which would have really added interest. It would have been better to do a layer of noise reduction, then mask it so you only smoothe out the sky or whatever you want smoothe selectively...overall, it''s nice, but is a little to ''fake smoothe'' for me 6</td>', 'OK, let me see...it looks like you used Neat Image, or some noise reduction. It has really taken away the grain of the wood which would have really added interest. It would have been better to do a layer of noise reduction, then mask it so you only smoothe out the sky or whatever you want smoothe selectively...overall, it''s nice, but is a little to ''fake smoothe'' for me 6', '2007-11-01 07:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
