(4211608, 600618, 40386, '<td valign="top">This is quite haunting, especially since I nearly lost my husband earler this year in a set up very similar to this.  I cant say that it is an appealing picture to look from an aesthetic point of view but I like your use of B&amp;W and the fact that it has the impact to stir the emotion that you probably intended it to prompt. 6</td>', 'This is quite haunting, especially since I nearly lost my husband earler this year in a set up very similar to this.  I cant say that it is an appealing picture to look from an aesthetic point of view but I like your use of B&W and the fact that it has the impact to stir the emotion that you probably intended it to prompt. 6', '2007-11-01 09:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4211617, 607344, 40386, '<td valign="top">Nice colorful photo, I wish that I could see it without the filter/HDR? painterly effect.  Brings back memories of my days in South Africa were I used to spend Sunday mornings having breakfast and reading the newspaper while I waited for my film to be processed at the local lab.  Good luck. 6</td>', 'Nice colorful photo, I wish that I could see it without the filter/HDR? painterly effect.  Brings back memories of my days in South Africa were I used to spend Sunday mornings having breakfast and reading the newspaper while I waited for my film to be processed at the local lab.  Good luck. 6', '2007-11-01 09:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
