(4211925, 600130, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2007-11-01 10:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4211927, 606011, 71244, '<td valign="top">I tend to do this too, I see a pretty scene and shoot it. I want to capture the moment of the sounds, air, water, etc. But when showing an image to people who were not there, they are taking it out of context and cannot feel the photographers experience without a center of interest (the house is too far away to  be one). Try placing something, like a child or a bird or something in the foreground, otherwise, its just a pretty scene, nothing special about it for the viewer. IMHO of course :)</td>', 'I tend to do this too, I see a pretty scene and shoot it. I want to capture the moment of the sounds, air, water, etc. But when showing an image to people who were not there, they are taking it out of context and cannot feel the photographers experience without a center of interest (the house is too far away to  be one). Try placing something, like a child or a bird or something in the foreground, otherwise, its just a pretty scene, nothing special about it for the viewer. IMHO of course :)', '2007-11-01 10:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4211928, 607462, 57886, '<td valign="top">Very nice....</td>', 'Very nice....', '2007-11-01 10:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
