(4211958, 607243, 30982, '<td valign="top">a different take on a waterfall - I like the close-up approach and the vibrant color of the plants on the rocks.</td>', 'a different take on a waterfall - I like the close-up approach and the vibrant color of the plants on the rocks.', '2007-11-01 11:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
