(4211977, 607167, 30982, '<td valign="top">GREAT smile!  Love it!  Love the pink against the plain wall, too.  What an exhuberant and joyful picture!</td>', 'GREAT smile!  Love it!  Love the pink against the plain wall, too.  What an exhuberant and joyful picture!', '2007-11-01 11:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
