(4211985, 605044, 77543, '<td valign="top">The background is too busy - use a larger aperture for less depth of field perhaps.<br/>The subject is too small in the frame - a tighter crop.<br/>The chain on the swing is cutting across the face - move to a slightly different camera position.</td>', 'The background is too busy - use a larger aperture for less depth of field perhaps.The subject is too small in the frame - a tighter crop.The chain on the swing is cutting across the face - move to a slightly different camera position.', '2007-11-01 11:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
