(4214615, 602448, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet car!  Nicely composed shot.</td>', 'Sweet car!  Nicely composed shot.', '2007-11-02 02:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214628, 607175, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the color layers - yellow, green, blue.  Nice.</td>', 'I like the color layers - yellow, green, blue.  Nice.', '2007-11-02 02:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214684, 605802, 30982, '<td valign="top">Such dignity in those faces.  Very nicely captured.</td>', 'Such dignity in those faces.  Very nicely captured.', '2007-11-02 02:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214685, 607277, 30982, '<td valign="top">Priceless.  Wonderful capture.</td>', 'Priceless.  Wonderful capture.', '2007-11-02 02:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214686, 606523, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice study - intriguing.</td>', 'A nice study - intriguing.', '2007-11-02 02:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214715, 607449, 50924, '<td valign="top">Stunning! To be in such a place once in your life is reward enough</td>', 'Stunning! To be in such a place once in your life is reward enough', '2007-11-02 03:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214753, 606165, 18197, '<td valign="top">Ouch! Colors feel pretty intense. I am prepared to believe they are real, but they hurt.</td>', 'Ouch! Colors feel pretty intense. I am prepared to believe they are real, but they hurt.', '2007-11-02 03:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214756, 607175, 8522, '<td valign="top">Composition is messy, way too many textures and colours with no clear point of focus. Sky takes up a small part of the shot, and looks accidental. This photo needs a clear choice as to whether there should be sky or not. Textures seem odd, maybe high ISO or something in Photoshop. Oversaturated to the point that my eyes almost want to bleed. The mist is nice, but because of the composition, it''s unclear as to whether it is a point of focus or not. Rule of thirds would definitely help here, the main horizontal line is bang in the middle of the shot which isn''t good.</td>', 'Composition is messy, way too many textures and colours with no clear point of focus. Sky takes up a small part of the shot, and looks accidental. This photo needs a clear choice as to whether there should be sky or not. Textures seem odd, maybe high ISO or something in Photoshop. Oversaturated to the point that my eyes almost want to bleed. The mist is nice, but because of the composition, it''s unclear as to whether it is a point of focus or not. Rule of thirds would definitely help here, the main horizontal line is bang in the middle of the shot which isn''t good.', '2007-11-02 03:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214761, 599684, 18197, '<td valign="top">It feels to me like you used too much noise reduction. Is this a real horse or an alabaster sculpture?</td>', 'It feels to me like you used too much noise reduction. Is this a real horse or an alabaster sculpture?', '2007-11-02 03:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214763, 598200, 8522, '<td valign="top">Burning of background is excessive and looks unnatural. Composition feels unbalanced, too much negative space on left, and unsure as to whether you wanted the model in the centre or not. Light is terrible, bad shadows cast especially on the wall and her face. She looks a little too posed, you don''t want a snapshot. Her face is a little red/purple which should have been fixed in PS. Lots of highlights in the dress make the composition worse, and take focus away from the face. Inclusion of plants in the foreground looks accidental, you should either have not included them, or make more of a feature of them. Her pose has not flattered her figure, she looks like she''s wearing a sack. I would have asked her to bring her hip in or to hide behind the door more. Hands are a very important part of any portrait, it looks like she wasn''t sure what to do with her right hand. She doesn''t seem terribly sharp, either bad focus or wrong shutter speed.</td>', 'Burning of background is excessive and looks unnatural. Composition feels unbalanced, too much negative space on left, and unsure as to whether you wanted the model in the centre or not. Light is terrible, bad shadows cast especially on the wall and her face. She looks a little too posed, you don''t want a snapshot. Her face is a little red/purple which should have been fixed in PS. Lots of highlights in the dress make the composition worse, and take focus away from the face. Inclusion of plants in the foreground looks accidental, you should either have not included them, or make more of a feature of them. Her pose has not flattered her figure, she looks like she''s wearing a sack. I would have asked her to bring her hip in or to hide behind the door more. Hands are a very important part of any portrait, it looks like she wasn''t sure what to do with her right hand. She doesn''t seem terribly sharp, either bad focus or wrong shutter speed.', '2007-11-02 03:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214770, 603245, 66616, '<td valign="top">very nice!</td>', 'very nice!', '2007-11-02 03:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214771, 606624, 8522, '<td valign="top">Some lovely colours, and very sharp. Composition doesn''t quite work for me though, it feels unbalanced and right-heavy. There''s too much negative space at the top of the frame for my taste, and the left of the shot does nothing for me. I personally would have chosen a longer lens and gone for a detail shot, prefereably from a different vantage point with a more interesting horizon.</td>', 'Some lovely colours, and very sharp. Composition doesn''t quite work for me though, it feels unbalanced and right-heavy. There''s too much negative space at the top of the frame for my taste, and the left of the shot does nothing for me. I personally would have chosen a longer lens and gone for a detail shot, prefereably from a different vantage point with a more interesting horizon.', '2007-11-02 03:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214785, 606925, 18197, '<td valign="top">Why B&amp;W when color would be fantastic?!</td>', 'Why B&W when color would be fantastic?!', '2007-11-02 04:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214788, 605495, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice Seattle Skyline!!!</td>', 'Very nice Seattle Skyline!!!', '2007-11-02 04:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214795, 603725, 18197, '<td valign="top">A bit too sharp for my taste.</td>', 'A bit too sharp for my taste.', '2007-11-02 04:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214796, 602492, 47482, '<td valign="top">love the colour, focus and wow factor in this shot!<br/> <br/>hope it does well, i''m sure this will ribbon!</td>', 'love the colour, focus and wow factor in this shot! hope it does well, i''m sure this will ribbon!', '2007-11-02 04:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214840, 604641, 48954, '<td valign="top">VERY COOL. really like this one.</td>', 'VERY COOL. really like this one.', '2007-11-02 04:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214843, 600833, 48954, '<td valign="top">pictures of toys never do well.  i do not recommend in the future.</td>', 'pictures of toys never do well.  i do not recommend in the future.', '2007-11-02 05:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214847, 599025, 48954, '<td valign="top">very interesting composition with the silhouettes and the shadows of the trees.  6</td>', 'very interesting composition with the silhouettes and the shadows of the trees.  6', '2007-11-02 05:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214850, 600198, 48954, '<td valign="top">is this one of those shots where you hook up the camera to a telescope? I would to do that some day. the problem with these shots though is  that they aren''t very dynamic. It''s cool, but static.</td>', 'is this one of those shots where you hook up the camera to a telescope? I would to do that some day. the problem with these shots though is  that they aren''t very dynamic. It''s cool, but static.', '2007-11-02 05:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214851, 607086, 48954, '<td valign="top">is this Dax my any chance?</td>', 'is this Dax my any chance?', '2007-11-02 05:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214855, 603946, 48954, '<td valign="top">clear, clean, crisp, well lit and saturated, this should do well.</td>', 'clear, clean, crisp, well lit and saturated, this should do well.', '2007-11-02 05:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214859, 606603, 48954, '<td valign="top">great capture, excellent lighting but i am not a fan of the processing. also the composition...seeing as how the light is coming from the left side, i have the impression that the crop should be tighter on the right and not on the left. otherwise, is a very dramatic shot.</td>', 'great capture, excellent lighting but i am not a fan of the processing. also the composition...seeing as how the light is coming from the left side, i have the impression that the crop should be tighter on the right and not on the left. otherwise, is a very dramatic shot.', '2007-11-02 05:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214860, 606905, 48954, '<td valign="top">great macro</td>', 'great macro', '2007-11-02 05:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214863, 598019, 48954, '<td valign="top">yeesh, image quality is low here. also the composition is weak. the empty space around is a waste of space. come in closer. the empty space doesn''t do anything for the photograph</td>', 'yeesh, image quality is low here. also the composition is weak. the empty space around is a waste of space. come in closer. the empty space doesn''t do anything for the photograph', '2007-11-02 05:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214864, 607320, 48954, '<td valign="top">good title. fun capture. I would have upped the contrast a little and dodged and burned a bit.</td>', 'good title. fun capture. I would have upped the contrast a little and dodged and burned a bit.', '2007-11-02 05:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214866, 597538, 48954, '<td valign="top">:) good title, good capture. Could have used more editing such as dodge and burn to make him jump out of the frame a bit more.</td>', ':) good title, good capture. Could have used more editing such as dodge and burn to make him jump out of the frame a bit more.', '2007-11-02 05:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214868, 601939, 48954, '<td valign="top">love the layers an  the mist. not a fan of the borders though</td>', 'love the layers an  the mist. not a fan of the borders though', '2007-11-02 05:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214869, 606806, 48954, '<td valign="top">i don''t really get the title. the fact that you don''t see the face also bothers me. it simply looks like you caught the wrong moment here. the lack of a visible face prevent s the viewer from being engaged in the shot i find.</td>', 'i don''t really get the title. the fact that you don''t see the face also bothers me. it simply looks like you caught the wrong moment here. the lack of a visible face prevent s the viewer from being engaged in the shot i find.', '2007-11-02 05:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214872, 606331, 30982, '<td valign="top">Before I saw the title, I thought "Friday night football" - very nicely captured!</td>', 'Before I saw the title, I thought "Friday night football" - very nicely captured!', '2007-11-02 05:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214874, 596514, 30982, '<td valign="top">The colors are almost surreal - and somehow that works for this.</td>', 'The colors are almost surreal - and somehow that works for this.', '2007-11-02 05:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214884, 605795, 30982, '<td valign="top">Will make a lovely Christmas card!</td>', 'Will make a lovely Christmas card!', '2007-11-02 05:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214893, 604291, 8522, '<td valign="top">I wrote a loong comment on this photo, but it was lost in the daily maintenance, so just a short one I''m afraid! Not keen on the b&amp;w tones, looks like you just pressed ''desturate'' rather than choose which colour channels to convert in the channel mixer. Shame whole photo isn''t in focus. Don''t like 3x4, 2x3 looks more professional. And this is a very cliched photo, if you''re taking a photo that has been taken so many times, it has to be exceptional or a little different.</td>', 'I wrote a loong comment on this photo, but it was lost in the daily maintenance, so just a short one I''m afraid! Not keen on the b&w tones, looks like you just pressed ''desturate'' rather than choose which colour channels to convert in the channel mixer. Shame whole photo isn''t in focus. Don''t like 3x4, 2x3 looks more professional. And this is a very cliched photo, if you''re taking a photo that has been taken so many times, it has to be exceptional or a little different.', '2007-11-02 05:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214898, 600111, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful grain, nice colours and tones.<br/>She''s turned away just a tad too far for my liking, the mouth looks a bit odd as a result.<br/>Dodge and burn is a bit uneven, especially bottom left and bottom right of frame.</td>', 'Beautiful grain, nice colours and tones.She''s turned away just a tad too far for my liking, the mouth looks a bit odd as a result.Dodge and burn is a bit uneven, especially bottom left and bottom right of frame.', '2007-11-02 05:37:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4214903, 597420, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely location, but size of cyclist feels a bit wrong for this shot. I''d have prefered more cyclist in the frame, either by getting closer or zooming in. I don''t like how the hill cuts into his waist, which is also dark... it confuses the eye. Nice use of leading lines. Foreground seems much sharper than the background, I''d have prefered this the other way around. Beautiful sky.</td>', 'Lovely location, but size of cyclist feels a bit wrong for this shot. I''d have prefered more cyclist in the frame, either by getting closer or zooming in. I don''t like how the hill cuts into his waist, which is also dark... it confuses the eye. Nice use of leading lines. Foreground seems much sharper than the background, I''d have prefered this the other way around. Beautiful sky.', '2007-11-02 05:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214905, 604641, 8522, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking, literally. Very bold composition, third of rules be damned! I do wonder what it would look like in colour... even artificially applied from black and white, perhaps painted in. I think the score will suffer for being in b&amp;w, it''s not pretty but it is striking.</td>', 'Breathtaking, literally. Very bold composition, third of rules be damned! I do wonder what it would look like in colour... even artificially applied from black and white, perhaps painted in. I think the score will suffer for being in b&w, it''s not pretty but it is striking.', '2007-11-02 05:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214908, 605856, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, and very striking on first glance. The more I look at it though, the more that things start to bother me about it. The composition doesn''t feel balanced and there is no clear point of focus amongst the buildings. The amount of negative space at the top of the shot feels a little superfluous. Although the horizon looks straight, the shape of the buildings in the water makes the photo feel like it is tilting to the left. One of the boats is blurry, I would have tried to make more of a feature out of this by making both boats very blurry. Here, it looks accidental. Nice contrast of warm and cool tones with your use of white balance though.</td>', 'Beautiful colours, and very striking on first glance. The more I look at it though, the more that things start to bother me about it. The composition doesn''t feel balanced and there is no clear point of focus amongst the buildings. The amount of negative space at the top of the shot feels a little superfluous. Although the horizon looks straight, the shape of the buildings in the water makes the photo feel like it is tilting to the left. One of the boats is blurry, I would have tried to make more of a feature out of this by making both boats very blurry. Here, it looks accidental. Nice contrast of warm and cool tones with your use of white balance though.', '2007-11-02 05:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214912, 605264, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very heavily photographed landmark, I feel that this shot is a bit of a wasted opportunity. Usually, photographers are attracted to the stunning plays of light, textures and shapes in this formation, whereas I feel that this looks more like an ''I was there'' kind of a shot. I don''t see an exploration and an awareness of all the aforementioned issues. Particularly bad is the inclusion of the edge of an arch on the left of the shot, which leads the eye out of the frame, a definite ''no no''.</td>', 'Very heavily photographed landmark, I feel that this shot is a bit of a wasted opportunity. Usually, photographers are attracted to the stunning plays of light, textures and shapes in this formation, whereas I feel that this looks more like an ''I was there'' kind of a shot. I don''t see an exploration and an awareness of all the aforementioned issues. Particularly bad is the inclusion of the edge of an arch on the left of the shot, which leads the eye out of the frame, a definite ''no no''.', '2007-11-02 05:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214914, 604557, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely exploration of colour, texture and lines. Composition feels a little unbalanced, too much grey, I feel that the green and grey should be equal or significantly different. Blues feel a bit oversatured. Wish there was something a little extra to this though, there''s a danger of it being just a net on a wall.</td>', 'Lovely exploration of colour, texture and lines. Composition feels a little unbalanced, too much grey, I feel that the green and grey should be equal or significantly different. Blues feel a bit oversatured. Wish there was something a little extra to this though, there''s a danger of it being just a net on a wall.', '2007-11-02 05:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214916, 606847, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, but OUCH MY EYES... talk about oversharpening. Professional and competent, but a little commercial for my taste.</td>', 'Lovely lighting, but OUCH MY EYES... talk about oversharpening. Professional and competent, but a little commercial for my taste.', '2007-11-02 05:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214918, 606134, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely subject, shame it''s overexposed. Background doesn''t quite work, the top right corner is too distracting. I feel like you''ve gone mad with the soft focus blur to disguise some of these issues. Composition doesn''t work for me, too much going on at the bottom of the shot. Greens and yellows need some colour balancing. Swans could be sharper.</td>', 'Lovely subject, shame it''s overexposed. Background doesn''t quite work, the top right corner is too distracting. I feel like you''ve gone mad with the soft focus blur to disguise some of these issues. Composition doesn''t work for me, too much going on at the bottom of the shot. Greens and yellows need some colour balancing. Swans could be sharper.', '2007-11-02 05:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214919, 607139, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautifully exposed, nice even background and good light, although I don''t like the shadow. Composition doesn''t work for me though and bothers me the more I look at it. Use of negative space doesn''t feel balanced. Not quite enough exploration of light, colour, textures and form to make me see this is a work of art rather than just a photo of flower.</td>', 'Beautifully exposed, nice even background and good light, although I don''t like the shadow. Composition doesn''t work for me though and bothers me the more I look at it. Use of negative space doesn''t feel balanced. Not quite enough exploration of light, colour, textures and form to make me see this is a work of art rather than just a photo of flower.', '2007-11-02 06:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214920, 600130, 8522, '<td valign="top">Rainbow not strong enough to make this shot worth it. Composition not strong. Sky overexposed. Foreground way oversharpened. Nice light and colours though.</td>', 'Rainbow not strong enough to make this shot worth it. Composition not strong. Sky overexposed. Foreground way oversharpened. Nice light and colours though.', '2007-11-02 06:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214922, 605686, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice detail but i really don''t like the super close crop</td>', 'nice detail but i really don''t like the super close crop', '2007-11-02 06:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214923, 607133, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice detail but the background is really oversaturated</td>', 'nice detail but the background is really oversaturated', '2007-11-02 06:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214924, 605630, 67152, '<td valign="top">awesome textures - the image seems just a bit oversharpened</td>', 'awesome textures - the image seems just a bit oversharpened', '2007-11-02 06:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214927, 602540, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oh, that is beautiul, I gave a sigh of appreciation just now when the shot loaded! Absolutely gorgeous. What delicious blues, and I love the crisp silhouette of the tree on the right. Mist is very atmospheric, and contrasts nicely with the sharp detail of the tree. There''s something quite poignant about this tree in the middle of water, it works on many levels... life, death, clarity, mystery and I love the haunting stillness.</td>', 'Oh, that is beautiul, I gave a sigh of appreciation just now when the shot loaded! Absolutely gorgeous. What delicious blues, and I love the crisp silhouette of the tree on the right. Mist is very atmospheric, and contrasts nicely with the sharp detail of the tree. There''s something quite poignant about this tree in the middle of water, it works on many levels... life, death, clarity, mystery and I love the haunting stillness.', '2007-11-02 06:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214928, 606624, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the silhoutte - it seems a bit close cropped but the colors are good</td>', 'i like the silhoutte - it seems a bit close cropped but the colors are good', '2007-11-02 06:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214929, 605740, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice soft colors - but this image really screams for a subject on the water</td>', 'nice soft colors - but this image really screams for a subject on the water', '2007-11-02 06:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214932, 600891, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the kinetic feel of this</td>', 'i love the kinetic feel of this', '2007-11-02 06:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214935, 600222, 67152, '<td valign="top">really well done compositin and sky - i just am not a huge fan of the oversaturated leaves in the foreground</td>', 'really well done compositin and sky - i just am not a huge fan of the oversaturated leaves in the foreground', '2007-11-02 06:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214937, 603664, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice story in this image, it really works...Why am i not surprised by a Canon in the hands of a predator photog!</td>', 'nice story in this image, it really works...Why am i not surprised by a Canon in the hands of a predator photog!', '2007-11-02 06:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214938, 606918, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t work for me, feels too contrived. Selective desat is a technique that many people use when the composition feels too cluttered, and I feel that may be the case here. I heavily dislike the magenta/purple. The part of the photo I do like is the red fringe at the top with the bells, and this is clumsily half included in the shot and out of focus. There is bad haloing around the horse and pole, as if you blurred everything else in Photoshop. Perhaps too much time spent staring at this in Photoshop has affected your judgement!</td>', 'Doesn''t work for me, feels too contrived. Selective desat is a technique that many people use when the composition feels too cluttered, and I feel that may be the case here. I heavily dislike the magenta/purple. The part of the photo I do like is the red fringe at the top with the bells, and this is clumsily half included in the shot and out of focus. There is bad haloing around the horse and pole, as if you blurred everything else in Photoshop. Perhaps too much time spent staring at this in Photoshop has affected your judgement!', '2007-11-02 06:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214939, 606528, 67152, '<td valign="top">quite a bit oversaturated and the image seems to be at a tilt</td>', 'quite a bit oversaturated and the image seems to be at a tilt', '2007-11-02 06:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214941, 602780, 67152, '<td valign="top">Good Golly - this is so cool!</td>', 'Good Golly - this is so cool!', '2007-11-02 06:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
