(4214948, 605042, 67152, '<td valign="top">Rich - I will not vote - but this really came out great.  I love the expression of both these beautiful people - especially the baby.  Really nice work on taking a ''nice picture'' and really creating something special.</td>', 'Rich - I will not vote - but this really came out great.  I love the expression of both these beautiful people - especially the baby.  Really nice work on taking a ''nice picture'' and really creating something special.', '2007-11-02 06:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
