(4214959, 605954, 67152, '<td valign="top">the repeating shapes of the waves really is a nice background for the image, but the backside view of the duck really does not work for me</td>', 'the repeating shapes of the waves really is a nice background for the image, but the backside view of the duck really does not work for me', '2007-11-02 06:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214960, 596511, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice light mist, some great colours in the sky. Wish there was more detail in the sky though, I''d have liked to see this half a stop to a stop darker. Not sure the background quite works with this lone tree, but maybe I''m too fussy... after all my time as a photographer I''m still searching for the elusive single tree shot that every photographer seems to have!</td>', 'Nice light mist, some great colours in the sky. Wish there was more detail in the sky though, I''d have liked to see this half a stop to a stop darker. Not sure the background quite works with this lone tree, but maybe I''m too fussy... after all my time as a photographer I''m still searching for the elusive single tree shot that every photographer seems to have!', '2007-11-02 06:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214962, 600111, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the pose - the lines work so well and the soft lighting really highlights the beauty of this young woman - but I really am having a hard time with the noise/grain - it seems very forced here - maybe in b/w the grain would come of better.  still, it gets a 6 for the good qualities</td>', 'i love the pose - the lines work so well and the soft lighting really highlights the beauty of this young woman - but I really am having a hard time with the noise/grain - it seems very forced here - maybe in b/w the grain would come of better.  still, it gets a 6 for the good qualities', '2007-11-02 06:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214963, 607049, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent balanced composition - love the tree in the light to balance the shadowed hills on the right</td>', 'excellent balanced composition - love the tree in the light to balance the shadowed hills on the right', '2007-11-02 06:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214965, 607075, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, even if it does look a little like an Athena poster! Bit too much negative space, I''d have cropped it tighter. Shame her back is slightly overexposed. There is something unsettlingly homoerotic about this though! Perhaps I would personally have liked an attempt to portray the woman with more softness or femininity as a contrast, but that''s just me.</td>', 'Wow, even if it does look a little like an Athena poster! Bit too much negative space, I''d have cropped it tighter. Shame her back is slightly overexposed. There is something unsettlingly homoerotic about this though! Perhaps I would personally have liked an attempt to portray the woman with more softness or femininity as a contrast, but that''s just me.', '2007-11-02 06:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4214966, 605740, 8522, '<td valign="top">Sky doesn''t look good, everything is way oversharpened. Desperately needs colour balancing. Composition is not at all compelling. Nothing interesting in this shot to look at.</td>', 'Sky doesn''t look good, everything is way oversharpened. Desperately needs colour balancing. Composition is not at all compelling. Nothing interesting in this shot to look at.', '2007-11-02 06:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
