(4214970, 605466, 67152, '<td valign="top">love the feel of the image but it seems a bit dark - i think a bit of levels adjustment would really bring out the shimmer in the water below while still allowing us to feel the darkness approaching</td>', 'love the feel of the image but it seems a bit dark - i think a bit of levels adjustment would really bring out the shimmer in the water below while still allowing us to feel the darkness approaching', '2007-11-02 06:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
