(4214977, 605620, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oh that''s gorgeous, one of the best photos I''ve seen in ages! Almost painterly, and very humourous in a good way. Lots of love in this shot. Great textures, good post processing. Tough exposure, handled well. Superb composition. Thanks for brightening my day, in fact I''ll keep this favourited so I can look at it when I want a lift!</td>', 'Oh that''s gorgeous, one of the best photos I''ve seen in ages! Almost painterly, and very humourous in a good way. Lots of love in this shot. Great textures, good post processing. Tough exposure, handled well. Superb composition. Thanks for brightening my day, in fact I''ll keep this favourited so I can look at it when I want a lift!', '2007-11-02 06:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
