(4215271, 607175, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  Personally, I would like to see more of the trees and mist and less of the foreground.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  Personally, I would like to see more of the trees and mist and less of the foreground.', '2007-11-02 09:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4215276, 607215, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the colors and the placemetn but I really think this could have used a bit of boost in dynamic range (adjustment of the levels (it seems a bit flat due to no real whites</td>', 'i love the colors and the placemetn but I really think this could have used a bit of boost in dynamic range (adjustment of the levels (it seems a bit flat due to no real whites', '2007-11-02 09:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
