(4215287, 602025, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene.  I''m losing the stream back in the rocks; maybe a little selective burning would make the stream''s path a stronger leading line to bring more interesting detail and depth to the middle of the image.</td>', 'Pretty scene.  I''m losing the stream back in the rocks; maybe a little selective burning would make the stream''s path a stronger leading line to bring more interesting detail and depth to the middle of the image.', '2007-11-02 09:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
