(4215390, 599412, 65234, '<td valign="top">The curls in the model''s hair are nicely lit.   But I really don''t care for the overall effect.</td>', 'The curls in the model''s hair are nicely lit.   But I really don''t care for the overall effect.', '2007-11-02 10:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
