(4215506, 605555, 65234, '<td valign="top">Makes me afraid I''m about to get tackled when the play starts!  Amazing detail.</td>', 'Makes me afraid I''m about to get tackled when the play starts!  Amazing detail.', '2007-11-02 10:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4215509, 606905, 65234, '<td valign="top">OMG, I am going to have NIGHTMARES about this one!  Well-composed, great detail and DOF, but I am not thanking you for this view!!</td>', 'OMG, I am going to have NIGHTMARES about this one!  Well-composed, great detail and DOF, but I am not thanking you for this view!!', '2007-11-02 10:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4215512, 606253, 65234, '<td valign="top">There''s an area of background to the right of the vase between it and the flowers which is completely washed out, while the rest is jet black.  The flowers are mostly washed out, too.  If that''s on purpose I don''t get what you''re trying to show me with the processing.</td>', 'There''s an area of background to the right of the vase between it and the flowers which is completely washed out, while the rest is jet black.  The flowers are mostly washed out, too.  If that''s on purpose I don''t get what you''re trying to show me with the processing.', '2007-11-02 10:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4215522, 606121, 65234, '<td valign="top">No, you will drool (Dogue de Bordeaux, yes?).  And you''ve got eye goobers.  Otherwise you make a good subject and showed off your wrinkles nicely.</td>', 'No, you will drool (Dogue de Bordeaux, yes?).  And you''ve got eye goobers.  Otherwise you make a good subject and showed off your wrinkles nicely.', '2007-11-02 10:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
