(4215752, 601377, 69668, '<td valign="top">Well....I am pretty positive this is Dr. Achoo kids?  If not they are adorable...if so ...they are adorable.  The image is nearly perfect. The lighting is fantastic, the colors are great, the exposure is right on, and the pose is darling.  They only thing I would change about this picture is the writing on your son''s shirt.  It is a bit distracitng.  A plain shirt would have workied even better.  Just my opinion....otherwise, I think the image is GREAT.</td>', 'Well....I am pretty positive this is Dr. Achoo kids?  If not they are adorable...if so ...they are adorable.  The image is nearly perfect. The lighting is fantastic, the colors are great, the exposure is right on, and the pose is darling.  They only thing I would change about this picture is the writing on your son''s shirt.  It is a bit distracitng.  A plain shirt would have workied even better.  Just my opinion....otherwise, I think the image is GREAT.', '2007-11-02 13:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
