(4215823, 607367, 41794, '<td valign="top">I know this view! I have been there myself.<br/>Gorgeous capture. I love the low clouds over the mountains and the speckle of fall colors.</td>', 'I know this view! I have been there myself.Gorgeous capture. I love the low clouds over the mountains and the speckle of fall colors.', '2007-11-02 13:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4215824, 603009, 81382, '<td valign="top">The verticals made from all the trees give the whole image a rightware slant. A bit of ccw rotation during the cropping phase would have squared everthing up nicely. Colours are a bit hazy, I''m guessing you were zooming in on the distance. Getting deeper blacks and increasing the tonal range at the bottom end would have helped</td>', 'The verticals made from all the trees give the whole image a rightware slant. A bit of ccw rotation during the cropping phase would have squared everthing up nicely. Colours are a bit hazy, I''m guessing you were zooming in on the distance. Getting deeper blacks and increasing the tonal range at the bottom end would have helped', '2007-11-02 13:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
