(4217922, 606443, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing image. I do enjoy a good blurry shot. I wish it was a bit brighter, that the whites were a notch or two lighter. But overall I think this is a great capture. The border is a bit heavy for the image, but that didnt factor into my vote. 8</td>', 'Very pleasing image. I do enjoy a good blurry shot. I wish it was a bit brighter, that the whites were a notch or two lighter. But overall I think this is a great capture. The border is a bit heavy for the image, but that didnt factor into my vote. 8', '2007-11-03 09:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4217924, 607239, 53147, '<td valign="top">One of the best portraits in the challenge IMO. The background is a wonderful frame. The colors, bokeh and patterns work wonderfully together. Great detail and focus on your model and the fact that your model isn''t one of those super pretty people (not that he is ugly by any means - just a normal guy) adds to the realness of the image. Well done.</td>', 'One of the best portraits in the challenge IMO. The background is a wonderful frame. The colors, bokeh and patterns work wonderfully together. Great detail and focus on your model and the fact that your model isn''t one of those super pretty people (not that he is ugly by any means - just a normal guy) adds to the realness of the image. Well done.', '2007-11-03 09:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4217943, 601275, 49109, '<td valign="top">gorgeous! very well composed shot, beautiful natural color. frame works perfect and makes it look like a painting</td>', 'gorgeous! very well composed shot, beautiful natural color. frame works perfect and makes it look like a painting', '2007-11-03 09:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
