(4218266, 607467, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice image, especially for this ''genre''.  Like the bird element, although shame it is not profiled/side on to show the beak.  Biggest detractors in this image (my opinion) are the cropping - top of the pier/jetty/boardwalk and the bottom gap in his pants/legs and that the sun, while a nice element is just a fraction too strong and taking away the ''focus'' on them.  Maybe tweaking in pp may have helped, but I imagine you''ve already done pp.</td>', 'Nice image, especially for this ''genre''.  Like the bird element, although shame it is not profiled/side on to show the beak.  Biggest detractors in this image (my opinion) are the cropping - top of the pier/jetty/boardwalk and the bottom gap in his pants/legs and that the sun, while a nice element is just a fraction too strong and taking away the ''focus'' on them.  Maybe tweaking in pp may have helped, but I imagine you''ve already done pp.', '2007-11-03 12:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4218267, 607220, 21124, '<td valign="top">I find this unusual composition very effective</td>', 'I find this unusual composition very effective', '2007-11-03 12:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
