(4218670, 606766, 39850, '<td valign="top">Ha.  Good opportunity here to get a little more than you have, in my opinion.  Taking the time to set these up and get your angle / position ready before ''placing'' the ''real'' pup (whom I''m guessing didn''t remain still for long), may have allowed the others to all be in the frame.  At first the skirting board was distracting but it, or the colors of it, do complement the image, as do the floorboards.  Excellent expression (and pose) on the ''real'' one - just all the ''chopping going on bottom and right of frame is unfortunate.</td>', 'Ha.  Good opportunity here to get a little more than you have, in my opinion.  Taking the time to set these up and get your angle / position ready before ''placing'' the ''real'' pup (whom I''m guessing didn''t remain still for long), may have allowed the others to all be in the frame.  At first the skirting board was distracting but it, or the colors of it, do complement the image, as do the floorboards.  Excellent expression (and pose) on the ''real'' one - just all the ''chopping going on bottom and right of frame is unfortunate.', '2007-11-03 17:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4218676, 607136, 39850, '<td valign="top">Shame the cow''s eye is chopped.  But the look captured on the dog is excellent.  Focus is good there too.  The blown whites detract from the image, as does the oof dog''s ear, but that is fairly minor.  Nice image.</td>', 'Shame the cow''s eye is chopped.  But the look captured on the dog is excellent.  Focus is good there too.  The blown whites detract from the image, as does the oof dog''s ear, but that is fairly minor.  Nice image.', '2007-11-03 17:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4218678, 607113, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice.  Like your frame color choice.  My eye wants to see it taper up the top, but it works well like this.  At first I thought this was some type of liquid flowing.  Nice quality.  Shame that the resizing has forced this to have some jagged edges - maybe trying to ''smooth'' those in pp, but minor.  I''m sure it is not there ''big''.</td>', '7 - Nice.  Like your frame color choice.  My eye wants to see it taper up the top, but it works well like this.  At first I thought this was some type of liquid flowing.  Nice quality.  Shame that the resizing has forced this to have some jagged edges - maybe trying to ''smooth'' those in pp, but minor.  I''m sure it is not there ''big''.', '2007-11-03 17:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4218682, 605062, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice sunset.  Like your composition.  That ''pole'' at the bottom keeps distracting me though.  Difficult, but if the silhouettes of the trees/leaves were just a little ''bolder''/sharper, make this even stronger in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Nice sunset.  Like your composition.  That ''pole'' at the bottom keeps distracting me though.  Difficult, but if the silhouettes of the trees/leaves were just a little ''bolder''/sharper, make this even stronger in my opinion.', '2007-11-03 17:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
