(4219514, 607336, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really a beautiful, serene scene.  Nice light, nice compostion.  Captures the warmth and glow of autumn well.</td>', 'Really a beautiful, serene scene.  Nice light, nice compostion.  Captures the warmth and glow of autumn well.', '2007-11-04 00:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219544, 598310, 39850, '<td valign="top">He/she looks like they''ve just seen a ghost.  Nice white whiskers against black fur.. nice potential with this feline.</td>', 'He/she looks like they''ve just seen a ghost.  Nice white whiskers against black fur.. nice potential with this feline.', '2007-11-04 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219548, 607302, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice rich color and contrast on the harbor.  Looks to have been a lovely evening!</td>', 'Nice rich color and contrast on the harbor.  Looks to have been a lovely evening!', '2007-11-04 01:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219549, 607284, 30982, '<td valign="top">Neat light for this shot!</td>', 'Neat light for this shot!', '2007-11-04 01:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219563, 606590, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Wow.  Could just be my eye being fooled by the reflections, but looks <i>slightly</i> off balance, like it needs a <i>fraction</i> up on the right - might also be perspective, apologies if I''m wrong.  Breathtaking scene, which I''m sure it was in person.  This image, with such beautiful symmetry, makes me want to see more sky, to balance (halve) the image.  Very nice.</td>', '8 - Wow.  Could just be my eye being fooled by the reflections, but looks slightly off balance, like it needs a fraction up on the right - might also be perspective, apologies if I''m wrong.  Breathtaking scene, which I''m sure it was in person.  This image, with such beautiful symmetry, makes me want to see more sky, to balance (halve) the image.  Very nice.', '2007-11-04 01:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219566, 607362, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very rich color in the reflection - nice composition to showcase it, too.</td>', 'Very rich color in the reflection - nice composition to showcase it, too.', '2007-11-04 01:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219571, 602488, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice image.</td>', '7 - Nice image.', '2007-11-04 01:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219572, 607146, 30982, '<td valign="top">The reflected gold is very pretty - seems almost a bit supernatural.</td>', 'The reflected gold is very pretty - seems almost a bit supernatural.', '2007-11-04 01:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219573, 607002, 60141, '<td valign="top">LOL///What on earth?  That''s the funniest bug I''ve ever seen.  You got it looking likt a silly monkey face!</td>', 'LOL///What on earth?  That''s the funniest bug I''ve ever seen.  You got it looking likt a silly monkey face!', '2007-11-04 01:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219575, 607211, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a cute little thing!  I love the soft pastels in this, and the clarity of the bird.</td>', 'What a cute little thing!  I love the soft pastels in this, and the clarity of the bird.', '2007-11-04 01:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219579, 607179, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot - really interesting to view and I like the darkness behind to bring out the feather.</td>', 'Very cool shot - really interesting to view and I like the darkness behind to bring out the feather.', '2007-11-04 01:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219596, 596758, 61863, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting! (good work)</td>', 'Looks like a painting! (good work)', '2007-11-04 01:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219606, 601939, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Ooh.  That''s nice.  Like your framing too.  The blues and mist/clouds seem so smooth against the contrasting mountains.</td>', '9 - Ooh.  That''s nice.  Like your framing too.  The blues and mist/clouds seem so smooth against the contrasting mountains.', '2007-11-04 01:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219613, 607174, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice contre-jour.  Love the way it highlights the trees.</td>', 'Nice contre-jour.  Love the way it highlights the trees.', '2007-11-04 01:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219616, 604926, 39850, '<td valign="top">Wish the moon was in focus, now that you mention it.  Nice image with it cropped out even.  Like the light on the cliffs.</td>', 'Wish the moon was in focus, now that you mention it.  Nice image with it cropped out even.  Like the light on the cliffs.', '2007-11-04 01:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219627, 605081, 30982, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a duotone but I can''t quite figure how you got the one small stripe of pink in the sky if that''s the case.  Very nice comp, nice light.</td>', 'Almost looks like a duotone but I can''t quite figure how you got the one small stripe of pink in the sky if that''s the case.  Very nice comp, nice light.', '2007-11-04 01:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219633, 606253, 39850, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you did here to the flowers and vase in pp, but the burning around the whole of the rest of the image is obvious.</td>', 'Not sure what you did here to the flowers and vase in pp, but the burning around the whole of the rest of the image is obvious.', '2007-11-04 01:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219635, 603708, 30982, '<td valign="top">Call me weird, but I kinda like the car in the picture.  Provides context and setting.  Fisheye?  Cool effect anyway!</td>', 'Call me weird, but I kinda like the car in the picture.  Provides context and setting.  Fisheye?  Cool effect anyway!', '2007-11-04 01:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219636, 607292, 39850, '<td valign="top">A variation in composition and framing would likely have made this a much stronger image.</td>', 'A variation in composition and framing would likely have made this a much stronger image.', '2007-11-04 01:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219639, 605271, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice, wish the ginger was in focus too - and the wasabi in view.</td>', 'Nice, wish the ginger was in focus too - and the wasabi in view.', '2007-11-04 01:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219643, 606651, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, nice lighting - but she looks a little ''odd'' with her fingers on the cake and her expression.</td>', 'Nice scene, nice lighting - but she looks a little ''odd'' with her fingers on the cake and her expression.', '2007-11-04 01:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219645, 606875, 30982, '<td valign="top">The color on this is just a tad bit off, which is too bad because it''s a great shot of a kitty.  Seems to have a touch too much green to me.</td>', 'The color on this is just a tad bit off, which is too bad because it''s a great shot of a kitty.  Seems to have a touch too much green to me.', '2007-11-04 01:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219650, 606651, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely a bit of a creepy take on Wonderland!</td>', 'Definitely a bit of a creepy take on Wonderland!', '2007-11-04 01:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219652, 607120, 39850, '<td valign="top">Good lord, had to look hard to see him/her, but once I did, well it''s hard to understand why I didn''t first see it.  Nice capture.  Bold composition, but I like it.  Shame the tassles aren''t nice and sharp too.  The background competes a fraction too much for attention, but minor, and does add something to this image, especially ''in the mouth''.</td>', 'Good lord, had to look hard to see him/her, but once I did, well it''s hard to understand why I didn''t first see it.  Nice capture.  Bold composition, but I like it.  Shame the tassles aren''t nice and sharp too.  The background competes a fraction too much for attention, but minor, and does add something to this image, especially ''in the mouth''.', '2007-11-04 01:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219657, 606351, 30982, '<td valign="top">Can''t decide if it''s a studio prop or a billboard.  What makes it interesting are the open windows.</td>', 'Can''t decide if it''s a studio prop or a billboard.  What makes it interesting are the open windows.', '2007-11-04 01:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219664, 605834, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like this idea and this shot, but the back of the front runner''s legs seem to have the aftereffects of either tone-mapping or shadows/highlights.  Looks to be a lovely morning!</td>', 'I like this idea and this shot, but the back of the front runner''s legs seem to have the aftereffects of either tone-mapping or shadows/highlights.  Looks to be a lovely morning!', '2007-11-04 01:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219667, 604286, 39850, '<td valign="top">Bigger (640) and a more refined crop (on the right) make this much better in my opinion.</td>', 'Bigger (640) and a more refined crop (on the right) make this much better in my opinion.', '2007-11-04 01:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219670, 607045, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice shot.  Shame about that twig, but minor.  Like the background ''dapples''.  Like your title.</td>', '8 - Nice shot.  Shame about that twig, but minor.  Like the background ''dapples''.  Like your title.', '2007-11-04 01:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
