(4219675, 596245, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice portrait.  Wish the eyes were either sharper or the rest of her had the same soft focus.  Shame the bottom of the curls (and button) are chopped.</td>', '7 - Nice portrait.  Wish the eyes were either sharper or the rest of her had the same soft focus.  Shame the bottom of the curls (and button) are chopped.', '2007-11-04 01:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219677, 602759, 39850, '<td valign="top">Wonder if ribbons cause depression as well..</td>', 'Wonder if ribbons cause depression as well..', '2007-11-04 01:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219680, 601865, 39850, '<td valign="top">Unusual.  Seems to be something strange going on at the bottom of your image.  Aside from that, perhaps slightly longer exposure (if you could) might have given this an edge, not sure.</td>', 'Unusual.  Seems to be something strange going on at the bottom of your image.  Aside from that, perhaps slightly longer exposure (if you could) might have given this an edge, not sure.', '2007-11-04 01:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219682, 607428, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the horse (and rider), just find the people in the background distracting/detract, but there was probably people in the background no matter where your viewpoint was.</td>', 'Nice capture of the horse (and rider), just find the people in the background distracting/detract, but there was probably people in the background no matter where your viewpoint was.', '2007-11-04 01:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219686, 605717, 39850, '<td valign="top">More detail, especially in textures would have been good.</td>', 'More detail, especially in textures would have been good.', '2007-11-04 01:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219693, 604928, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice focus.  Difficult, but if you had a little more room to include on one of the sides to vary the composition, may have given this image a little extra.</td>', '7 - Nice focus.  Difficult, but if you had a little more room to include on one of the sides to vary the composition, may have given this image a little extra.', '2007-11-04 01:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219698, 607214, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gentle and peaceful.  I like it.</td>', 'Gentle and peaceful.  I like it.', '2007-11-04 01:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219700, 601866, 30982, '<td valign="top">Is it a private pier?  One wonders how any such lovely place as this would go deserted for very long.</td>', 'Is it a private pier?  One wonders how any such lovely place as this would go deserted for very long.', '2007-11-04 01:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219704, 602536, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Beautiful scene, well captured and framed/composed.  Looks like a painting.  Like to see a bit more detail, mainly in the ''wise old rocks'', but minor and anyway your call, of course.</td>', '8 - Beautiful scene, well captured and framed/composed.  Looks like a painting.  Like to see a bit more detail, mainly in the ''wise old rocks'', but minor and anyway your call, of course.', '2007-11-04 01:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219706, 606486, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - He''s beautiful, beautifully captured with this sky too.  Just wish I could either discern more detail in the Vaquero, or otherwise if keeping as a silhouette (almost) like this, some separation between him and this magnificent creature, so as not to ''intrude'' upon him in this image (hope that makes sense).  Nice image.</td>', '8 - He''s beautiful, beautifully captured with this sky too.  Just wish I could either discern more detail in the Vaquero, or otherwise if keeping as a silhouette (almost) like this, some separation between him and this magnificent creature, so as not to ''intrude'' upon him in this image (hope that makes sense).  Nice image.', '2007-11-04 01:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219708, 607363, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  Majestic indeed.</td>', 'Lovely!  Majestic indeed.', '2007-11-04 01:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219709, 605429, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  I have to believe this would look awesome printed, too.  Nice work!</td>', 'Excellent capture.  I have to believe this would look awesome printed, too.  Nice work!', '2007-11-04 01:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219710, 607174, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice, unique.  Minor, but I wish the photographer was the only one in the frame.  Or maybe that''s just ''another'' image.  Like the perspective, gives good sense of size.</td>', '8 - Nice, unique.  Minor, but I wish the photographer was the only one in the frame.  Or maybe that''s just ''another'' image.  Like the perspective, gives good sense of size.', '2007-11-04 01:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
