(4219784, 603076, 30982, '<td valign="top">Intriguing fellow (or lady) - looks like it has wet paint spilled on it!  Incidentally, since I have to scroll to comment, it looks better if cropped just below the red horizontal stem - that keeps enough of the darkness behind for depth but focuses more attention on the nifty frog/toad guy.</td>', 'Intriguing fellow (or lady) - looks like it has wet paint spilled on it!  Incidentally, since I have to scroll to comment, it looks better if cropped just below the red horizontal stem - that keeps enough of the darkness behind for depth but focuses more attention on the nifty frog/toad guy.', '2007-11-04 03:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219788, 605858, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''ll take both if you don''t mind.  I like that the one gent managed to find his ball in that thick stuff - or maybe he just dropped there.  A very nice slice of life shot - very enjoyable!</td>', 'I''ll take both if you don''t mind.  I like that the one gent managed to find his ball in that thick stuff - or maybe he just dropped there.  A very nice slice of life shot - very enjoyable!', '2007-11-04 03:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
