(4219812, 601928, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool view.  Fisheye?  C-130?  Has more relief in it than I would expect from Iraq, though.  Nice editing, too.</td>', 'Very cool view.  Fisheye?  C-130?  Has more relief in it than I would expect from Iraq, though.  Nice editing, too.', '2007-11-04 04:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219818, 607239, 8522, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the colour balancing... he looks quite ill. I''d have used Photoshop to fix the lazy eye.</td>', 'Don''t like the colour balancing... he looks quite ill. I''d have used Photoshop to fix the lazy eye.', '2007-11-04 04:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219821, 607204, 8522, '<td valign="top">Needs more colour balancing... I''m not sure the white balance was good here. Lots of empty negative space to the left, not a very convincing composition. Why form a chord with the left hand if the right hand is posing for the camera? A bit of a mixed message there. Nice model, you''ve not flattered her ankle and you should generally aim not to see the bottom of the feet in a portrait. Have you come across rule of thirds? That will help you. Nice shallow dof, good bokeh.</td>', 'Needs more colour balancing... I''m not sure the white balance was good here. Lots of empty negative space to the left, not a very convincing composition. Why form a chord with the left hand if the right hand is posing for the camera? A bit of a mixed message there. Nice model, you''ve not flattered her ankle and you should generally aim not to see the bottom of the feet in a portrait. Have you come across rule of thirds? That will help you. Nice shallow dof, good bokeh.', '2007-11-04 04:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219822, 604928, 8522, '<td valign="top">Competent, but not massively creative or original.</td>', 'Competent, but not massively creative or original.', '2007-11-04 04:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219824, 602448, 8522, '<td valign="top">Haha, not because you love learning, or want to make the world a better place, or want to reach your potential. Just a flash car. Man, I hate materialism. Anyway, your model needs more light... offboard carefully bounced flash is badly needed here. You don''t have great reflections on the car, this needed more thought. Were you trying to light your model with the lights from another car? This hasn''t worked, as the light isn''t high enough. The sky is very poor, and really makes the shoot look amateur. You needed a little more dof so the background skyline would be in focus. It doesn''t look good here. Or far more blurred. The model''s clothes don''t work well for this concept, not classy or thought out at all. Not a compelling expression either. He almost has a tower growing from his head... I don''t feel that you were aware of the composition of how his head blends with the background. A far more inventive shot may have been to bring a very high stepladder so you could get the same shot with the same background but looking down on him.</td>', 'Haha, not because you love learning, or want to make the world a better place, or want to reach your potential. Just a flash car. Man, I hate materialism. Anyway, your model needs more light... offboard carefully bounced flash is badly needed here. You don''t have great reflections on the car, this needed more thought. Were you trying to light your model with the lights from another car? This hasn''t worked, as the light isn''t high enough. The sky is very poor, and really makes the shoot look amateur. You needed a little more dof so the background skyline would be in focus. It doesn''t look good here. Or far more blurred. The model''s clothes don''t work well for this concept, not classy or thought out at all. Not a compelling expression either. He almost has a tower growing from his head... I don''t feel that you were aware of the composition of how his head blends with the background. A far more inventive shot may have been to bring a very high stepladder so you could get the same shot with the same background but looking down on him.', '2007-11-04 04:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219827, 606983, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lots of unused negative space on the right of the shot. Photos like these really need to have the subject looking INTO the frame, composition doesn''t feel at all thought out. Bad skin tone, needs colour balancing caused by the flash catching all the surface blood just under the skin. Eyes don''t have a really great expression that makes good gig photos come alive. Why is this photo so small?</td>', 'Lots of unused negative space on the right of the shot. Photos like these really need to have the subject looking INTO the frame, composition doesn''t feel at all thought out. Bad skin tone, needs colour balancing caused by the flash catching all the surface blood just under the skin. Eyes don''t have a really great expression that makes good gig photos come alive. Why is this photo so small?', '2007-11-04 04:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219828, 607462, 8522, '<td valign="top">My God that place looks hideous, is it Disneyland? Sky feels too artifical, looks like colours are as a result of PS. Shame there are no clouds, composition feels like it needs something extra in it to add some interest. Shot is too blurry.</td>', 'My God that place looks hideous, is it Disneyland? Sky feels too artifical, looks like colours are as a result of PS. Shame there are no clouds, composition feels like it needs something extra in it to add some interest. Shot is too blurry.', '2007-11-04 04:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219829, 604926, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nifty lighting conditions, very pleasing composition.</td>', 'Nifty lighting conditions, very pleasing composition.', '2007-11-04 05:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219830, 600130, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice image.  Like the faint spectrum captured.  Nice colors in the landscape and flora.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Nice image.  Like the faint spectrum captured.  Nice colors in the landscape and flora.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2007-11-04 05:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219831, 604605, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering why you would post this in a challenge on DPC... it''s a family snapshot with no artistic redeeming qualities. There''s nothing about this to show it was a competently taken photograph, and I don''t know why you would expect a stranger to be interested in it.</td>', 'I''m wondering why you would post this in a challenge on DPC... it''s a family snapshot with no artistic redeeming qualities. There''s nothing about this to show it was a competently taken photograph, and I don''t know why you would expect a stranger to be interested in it.', '2007-11-04 05:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219832, 598746, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot of a very pretty cat.</td>', 'Very nice shot of a very pretty cat.', '2007-11-04 05:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219833, 601931, 8522, '<td valign="top">Some great textures and colours, even if they are completely over the top as a result of PS, so such a shame that the composition feels so unbalanced. Why put the horizon not quite in the centre? Is there really enough interest in the sky to warrant it taking up most of the shot? Not sure about the amount of negative space to the left of the shot.</td>', 'Some great textures and colours, even if they are completely over the top as a result of PS, so such a shame that the composition feels so unbalanced. Why put the horizon not quite in the centre? Is there really enough interest in the sky to warrant it taking up most of the shot? Not sure about the amount of negative space to the left of the shot.', '2007-11-04 05:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219834, 603540, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot to show the proximity to homes - good action with the drop as well.</td>', 'Great shot to show the proximity to homes - good action with the drop as well.', '2007-11-04 05:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219835, 607149, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, textures and feel. However, although I like the idea of your foreground, I would prefer the shot without the bottom 3rd of it as a square crop. A bit too much soft focus, is this because the shot wasn''t razor sharp to start with? Also, I''d have liked a slower shutter speed to capture the water with a more smooth texture.</td>', 'Lovely colours, textures and feel. However, although I like the idea of your foreground, I would prefer the shot without the bottom 3rd of it as a square crop. A bit too much soft focus, is this because the shot wasn''t razor sharp to start with? Also, I''d have liked a slower shutter speed to capture the water with a more smooth texture.', '2007-11-04 05:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219837, 598734, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very cartoony, not sure how I feel about that. I want to like it, as it''s a striking effect but it does start to feel like graphic design.</td>', 'Very cartoony, not sure how I feel about that. I want to like it, as it''s a striking effect but it does start to feel like graphic design.', '2007-11-04 05:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
