(4219888, 606443, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has an ethereal grace to it.  I think a bit of brightening of the white balance - make the back wall and her skirt just a tad less gray - will add just a bit of a spark.  The composition is great and I love the motion - her body moving is ALMOST bending the lines, giving life to the inanimate around her.</td>', 'Has an ethereal grace to it.  I think a bit of brightening of the white balance - make the back wall and her skirt just a tad less gray - will add just a bit of a spark.  The composition is great and I love the motion - her body moving is ALMOST bending the lines, giving life to the inanimate around her.', '2007-11-04 06:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219892, 600025, 30982, '<td valign="top">OK, patience pays off... were I to judge this on just the top third (it took three tries to get the whole picture) it would have scored a point lower - the bottom two thirds definitely makes this picture - love the grays and pinks (always a good combo.)</td>', 'OK, patience pays off... were I to judge this on just the top third (it took three tries to get the whole picture) it would have scored a point lower - the bottom two thirds definitely makes this picture - love the grays and pinks (always a good combo.)', '2007-11-04 06:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219893, 603946, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and perspective.</td>', 'Nice focus and perspective.', '2007-11-04 06:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219894, 603946, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail and color on this - and a nice complimentary bokeh to top it off.</td>', 'Wonderful detail and color on this - and a nice complimentary bokeh to top it off.', '2007-11-04 06:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219896, 606768, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I wonder about a little more height, for added balance.  Not sure whether from resizing, but there seems to be some artifact/something issues in the pixels.</td>', 'Nice image.  I wonder about a little more height, for added balance.  Not sure whether from resizing, but there seems to be some artifact/something issues in the pixels.', '2007-11-04 06:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219899, 605659, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Really like this and think the darkness is good (although maybe a fraction more detail bottom left might be better) - ''bigger'' probably has more detail overall.  The main detractor for me in this image is the horizon sloping down to the right.. could be perspective, either way, I think it is important in this image.  Beautiful sky.</td>', '6 - Really like this and think the darkness is good (although maybe a fraction more detail bottom left might be better) - ''bigger'' probably has more detail overall.  The main detractor for me in this image is the horizon sloping down to the right.. could be perspective, either way, I think it is important in this image.  Beautiful sky.', '2007-11-04 06:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219900, 606356, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Wish it were 640, if the quality was there.  Nice capture.</td>', '7 - Wish it were 640, if the quality was there.  Nice capture.', '2007-11-04 06:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219905, 606215, 39850, '<td valign="top">Seems to be an issue upper right corner.  The infrared works well with this scene.</td>', 'Seems to be an issue upper right corner.  The infrared works well with this scene.', '2007-11-04 06:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219907, 604648, 39850, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  Shame you''ve lost the detail of the far mountains upper right.  Perhaps cropping that out (and  possibly even a square framing) may have removed that distracting/detracting element.  Very nice colors in the land.</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  Shame you''ve lost the detail of the far mountains upper right.  Perhaps cropping that out (and  possibly even a square framing) may have removed that distracting/detracting element.  Very nice colors in the land.', '2007-11-04 06:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219912, 600519, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice simplicity.  Looks like a lovely garden.  The oof leaves in the background, whilst offer a nice shaped bokeh and additional character to the image, the blown part is distracting and takes attention away from the main subject.  Like the gossamer thread captured too.  More refined crop at the very bottom to eliminate that something I just noticed, but minor.</td>', 'Nice simplicity.  Looks like a lovely garden.  The oof leaves in the background, whilst offer a nice shaped bokeh and additional character to the image, the blown part is distracting and takes attention away from the main subject.  Like the gossamer thread captured too.  More refined crop at the very bottom to eliminate that something I just noticed, but minor.', '2007-11-04 07:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219916, 598747, 39850, '<td valign="top">Don''t understand why you wouldn''t take the time to ''set up'' such beautiful blue eyes ''in'' an image that really showcases them, but your call.  Very difficult when one is emotionally attached to an image and just viewing it ''as an image''.</td>', 'Don''t understand why you wouldn''t take the time to ''set up'' such beautiful blue eyes ''in'' an image that really showcases them, but your call.  Very difficult when one is emotionally attached to an image and just viewing it ''as an image''.', '2007-11-04 07:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
