(4219921, 605685, 66060, '<td valign="top">Don''t think the flash worked all too well for me.. (as well as the right-heavy composition), 5.</td>', 'Don''t think the flash worked all too well for me.. (as well as the right-heavy composition), 5.', '2007-11-04 07:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4219922, 607204, 39850, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a tighter crop (left and bottom) may have made this a stronger image.  Good focus and nice expression.  The pose is nice but I just noticed she has her fingers on the chords, yet the other hand is not playing, so perhaps relaxing that hand - but minor and, may have ended up too ''directed''.</td>', 'Perhaps a tighter crop (left and bottom) may have made this a stronger image.  Good focus and nice expression.  The pose is nice but I just noticed she has her fingers on the chords, yet the other hand is not playing, so perhaps relaxing that hand - but minor and, may have ended up too ''directed''.', '2007-11-04 07:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
