(4220000, 602540, 7786, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is an amazing image. By far the best I have seen yet in this challenge. The reflection is perfect and the mist adds a magical feeling to it. If something could be better it would be that the blue tone on the bottom of the image is little out of sync with the gray overall tone. But thats a small detail.</td>', 'Wow. This is an amazing image. By far the best I have seen yet in this challenge. The reflection is perfect and the mist adds a magical feeling to it. If something could be better it would be that the blue tone on the bottom of the image is little out of sync with the gray overall tone. But thats a small detail.', '2007-11-04 08:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
