(4221834, 602438, 69646, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Reflections and Great Colors!</td>', 'Beautiful Reflections and Great Colors!', '2007-11-05 01:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4221837, 606134, 69646, '<td valign="top">Great Shot!!</td>', 'Great Shot!!', '2007-11-05 01:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4221848, 596514, 8522, '<td valign="top">Some strange colour editing, looks like the cow is on artificial grass. Composition feels unbalanced. The eyes are the focal point of the shot, and they don''t look right in this location within the frame.</td>', 'Some strange colour editing, looks like the cow is on artificial grass. Composition feels unbalanced. The eyes are the focal point of the shot, and they don''t look right in this location within the frame.', '2007-11-05 01:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4221853, 607256, 8522, '<td valign="top">Why is the focus on the chain and not on the guy''s face? No sense of context, it feels like the photo is trying to tell a story and we have no idea what it is. Burnt out background bokeh not good.</td>', 'Why is the focus on the chain and not on the guy''s face? No sense of context, it feels like the photo is trying to tell a story and we have no idea what it is. Burnt out background bokeh not good.', '2007-11-05 01:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4221856, 605543, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, but composition doesn''t feel thought out and quality of light too harsh.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, but composition doesn''t feel thought out and quality of light too harsh.', '2007-11-05 01:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4221862, 602492, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow! Colour balance is a little too much on the purple side for my taste but wow, great composition and light. Lovely textures and dof.</td>', 'Wow! Colour balance is a little too much on the purple side for my taste but wow, great composition and light. Lovely textures and dof.', '2007-11-05 01:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4221866, 596020, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame about the burnt out highlights in the background, looks accidental rather than deliverate. Skin tones need more colour balancing. Other than that, nice shot.</td>', 'Shame about the burnt out highlights in the background, looks accidental rather than deliverate. Skin tones need more colour balancing. Other than that, nice shot.', '2007-11-05 01:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4221880, 605937, 8522, '<td valign="top">Is that really a ''cello? Looks very thin, more like a violin or viola.</td>', 'Is that really a ''cello? Looks very thin, more like a violin or viola.', '2007-11-05 01:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4221881, 602037, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks like the Paragon mall in Bangkok, I love that place.</td>', 'Looks like the Paragon mall in Bangkok, I love that place.', '2007-11-05 01:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222084, 601866, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Wow.  Beautiful pier, exquisitely captured.  Love your nice straight lines.  At first I wanted to see the sky hold some more interest, but I think it allows the pier to shine through.  If anything, maybe a more horizontal crop/more width, but at this size you would likely lose too much.  Changing anything about the crop/framing would just create ''another'' (excellent) image.</td>', '9 - Wow.  Beautiful pier, exquisitely captured.  Love your nice straight lines.  At first I wanted to see the sky hold some more interest, but I think it allows the pier to shine through.  If anything, maybe a more horizontal crop/more width, but at this size you would likely lose too much.  Changing anything about the crop/framing would just create ''another'' (excellent) image.', '2007-11-05 05:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222090, 607004, 39850, '<td valign="top">Like to have seen a little more texture discernible.  Looks like natural lighting but not sure it is highlighting this rose, including the color, as well as stronger lighting may have.</td>', 'Like to have seen a little more texture discernible.  Looks like natural lighting but not sure it is highlighting this rose, including the color, as well as stronger lighting may have.', '2007-11-05 05:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222096, 606171, 39850, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors in the sky and mountains.  Like the earthy green in the land.  At this size, this image seems so ''confined'', just wish I could discern the detail that is likely there ''wall sized''.</td>', 'Beautiful colors in the sky and mountains.  Like the earthy green in the land.  At this size, this image seems so ''confined'', just wish I could discern the detail that is likely there ''wall sized''.', '2007-11-05 05:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222101, 601928, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Unique, that''s for sure.  If not for the blue, could be over another planet.  Minor, but my eye keeps looking at the symmetry.  Really like that landscape color and formation.</td>', '8 - Unique, that''s for sure.  If not for the blue, could be over another planet.  Minor, but my eye keeps looking at the symmetry.  Really like that landscape color and formation.', '2007-11-05 05:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222103, 603846, 39850, '<td valign="top">The anthers closest to the lens in more focus, make this even better in my opinion.</td>', 'The anthers closest to the lens in more focus, make this even better in my opinion.', '2007-11-05 06:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222106, 603285, 39850, '<td valign="top">She looks very young for this costume, make up and ''raising a glass''.</td>', 'She looks very young for this costume, make up and ''raising a glass''.', '2007-11-05 06:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222109, 603725, 39850, '<td valign="top">Difficult, but the lighting/something seems a bit harsh.  The green in the feathers at the back of the head seems blown.</td>', 'Difficult, but the lighting/something seems a bit harsh.  The green in the feathers at the back of the head seems blown.', '2007-11-05 06:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222113, 604377, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice effect of the fore and rear bokeh in the grass.  The white, etc background cropped out makes a stronger image, in my opinion.  Nice focal point.  Wish her other eye was more visible or else ''not''.</td>', 'Nice effect of the fore and rear bokeh in the grass.  The white, etc background cropped out makes a stronger image, in my opinion.  Nice focal point.  Wish her other eye was more visible or else ''not''.', '2007-11-05 06:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222121, 607405, 39850, '<td valign="top">Despite your title, she looks a little unsure.  Wish the eyes had the same sharpness in focus as the hair seems to have.  Nice simple colors in the image.</td>', 'Despite your title, she looks a little unsure.  Wish the eyes had the same sharpness in focus as the hair seems to have.  Nice simple colors in the image.', '2007-11-05 06:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222127, 601275, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Bold framing.  Works though without losing the required details in the image.  The clouds perhaps dominate a little too much, but could be just as you intended.</td>', '8 - Bold framing.  Works though without losing the required details in the image.  The clouds perhaps dominate a little too much, but could be just as you intended.', '2007-11-05 06:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222130, 606273, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Oh that''s nice.  Very difficult, but I do wish I could see more detail in that fore bud.  Really like your composition and the colors are very soothing and warm.  Minor, but the edge of the petal creeping into frame on the left is a little distracting once you notice it.</td>', '8 - Oh that''s nice.  Very difficult, but I do wish I could see more detail in that fore bud.  Really like your composition and the colors are very soothing and warm.  Minor, but the edge of the petal creeping into frame on the left is a little distracting once you notice it.', '2007-11-05 06:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222146, 604641, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice effect.  Toning works well.  A more refined crop on the right to eliminate that rock creeping in make this even stronger in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Nice effect.  Toning works well.  A more refined crop on the right to eliminate that rock creeping in make this even stronger in my opinion.', '2007-11-05 06:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222154, 607432, 39850, '<td valign="top">Difficult, but perhaps a bold crop to eliminate the tree may have produced a stronger image, if the quality was there.  Maybe a tweaking of the levels/colors/saturation to get more ''depth'' too.  Good range of colors captured in the lightning.</td>', 'Difficult, but perhaps a bold crop to eliminate the tree may have produced a stronger image, if the quality was there.  Maybe a tweaking of the levels/colors/saturation to get more ''depth'' too.  Good range of colors captured in the lightning.', '2007-11-05 06:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222162, 602161, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice image.</td>', '7 - Nice image.', '2007-11-05 06:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222175, 604437, 39850, '<td valign="top">Ducky is getting lost against the background of the water.  Nice capture but appears to be some blur in the head especially.</td>', 'Ducky is getting lost against the background of the water.  Nice capture but appears to be some blur in the head especially.', '2007-11-05 06:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222187, 607220, 39850, '<td valign="top">Beautiful creature.  That gorgeous colored eye against the green background is very nice.  Like the detail in the nose.  Biggest detractor in this image in my opinion is the noise/grain visible in the darker areas.  I''m guessing you had to crop it like this for a reason, unless it is intentional.</td>', 'Beautiful creature.  That gorgeous colored eye against the green background is very nice.  Like the detail in the nose.  Biggest detractor in this image in my opinion is the noise/grain visible in the darker areas.  I''m guessing you had to crop it like this for a reason, unless it is intentional.', '2007-11-05 06:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222204, 604830, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Beautiful scene.  The vertical crop works but I do wonder about a little more space to where they are going, if you had it of course.  The horizon/water seems slightly off so perhaps a nudge up on the left.  Like the clothing - including over the horse.</td>', '7 - Beautiful scene.  The vertical crop works but I do wonder about a little more space to where they are going, if you had it of course.  The horizon/water seems slightly off so perhaps a nudge up on the left.  Like the clothing - including over the horse.', '2007-11-05 06:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222206, 607342, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Perhaps a variation in crop, especially to get the paws in or out, may have made this even better.  The leaves add a nice touch.<i>edit:typos</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-08 00:46:37.</i></td>', 'Nice lighting.  Perhaps a variation in crop, especially to get the paws in or out, may have made this even better.  The leaves add a nice touch.edit:typos', '2007-11-05 06:49:53.000000', '2007-11-08 00:46:37.000000', 1),
(4222210, 605986, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus.', '2007-11-05 06:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222221, 606330, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Beautiful portrait.  Clothing is pretty and adds nice character.  Lighting is very nice.  Only two things I can suggest are the background / backdrop visible bottom left (more in or else out) and <i>possibly</i> a variation in crop/framing, but both quite minor.</td>', '8 - Beautiful portrait.  Clothing is pretty and adds nice character.  Lighting is very nice.  Only two things I can suggest are the background / backdrop visible bottom left (more in or else out) and possibly a variation in crop/framing, but both quite minor.', '2007-11-05 07:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4222228, 607127, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice capture.  Wonder about a variation in composition to give this a little extra, but not sure on that as the more I look at it, the more I like it like this.  Like the tones.  Make a good print.</td>', '7 - Nice capture.  Wonder about a variation in composition to give this a little extra, but not sure on that as the more I look at it, the more I like it like this.  Like the tones.  Make a good print.', '2007-11-05 07:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
