(4224934, 606150, 30982, '<td valign="top">Normally I am not at all fond of shots where the camera is looking down the barrel of a gun.  Just not my cup of tea at all.  But this one seems to carry a bit of a story with it and I love the powerlines for some odd reason.  So I''ll even vote on it (I usually don''t vote on shots where I have to look down the barrel of a gun.)</td>', 'Normally I am not at all fond of shots where the camera is looking down the barrel of a gun.  Just not my cup of tea at all.  But this one seems to carry a bit of a story with it and I love the powerlines for some odd reason.  So I''ll even vote on it (I usually don''t vote on shots where I have to look down the barrel of a gun.)', '2007-11-06 09:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
