(4224986, 606780, 7786, '<td valign="top">The Acorn is hnife sharp. Good control of DOF here. Having the background in the same color as your object doesn´t bring out your subject enough. A background in a contrasting color (Yellow) would have made this one a excellent picture.</td>', 'The Acorn is hnife sharp. Good control of DOF here. Having the background in the same color as your object doesn´t bring out your subject enough. A background in a contrasting color (Yellow) would have made this one a excellent picture.', '2007-11-06 10:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4224989, 607469, 7786, '<td valign="top">A amazing place which I never get tired of seeing pictures from, specially as well composed as this one. Nice work.</td>', 'A amazing place which I never get tired of seeing pictures from, specially as well composed as this one. Nice work.', '2007-11-06 10:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225067, 607075, 2612, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo and I will rate is a such, probably 8-9, but I''m curious about the title. Nothing in the photo explains or suggests anything final, yet the title states "The Final Embrace". Something to suggest final, a subtle prop in the frame but not in focus for example, would really help if you want to tell a story here. Great work... but the title has left me wanting even more.<br/> <br/>Thanks for sharing!</td>', 'This is a great photo and I will rate is a such, probably 8-9, but I''m curious about the title. Nothing in the photo explains or suggests anything final, yet the title states "The Final Embrace". Something to suggest final, a subtle prop in the frame but not in focus for example, would really help if you want to tell a story here. Great work... but the title has left me wanting even more. Thanks for sharing!', '2007-11-06 11:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
