(4225533, 607469, 67883, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the composition. An alternative angle would have been better for example looking somewhere over the whole canyon instead of having the big pillar on the left distracting the view, for short a better foreground. I think this photograph needs a more critical subject focus. Boosting the colors a bit would have been nice also to bring out the reddish color of the rocks.</td>', 'I don''t like the composition. An alternative angle would have been better for example looking somewhere over the whole canyon instead of having the big pillar on the left distracting the view, for short a better foreground. I think this photograph needs a more critical subject focus. Boosting the colors a bit would have been nice also to bring out the reddish color of the rocks.', '2007-11-06 15:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225535, 607037, 68586, '<td valign="top">I like the urban ''grungy'' feel to the top 2/3''s of this picture - but the red brick wall just looks to clean and neat to finish the picture off for me. <br/> <br/>Good to see something so different though.</td>', 'I like the urban ''grungy'' feel to the top 2/3''s of this picture - but the red brick wall just looks to clean and neat to finish the picture off for me.  Good to see something so different though.', '2007-11-06 15:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
