(4225587, 607424, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice textures in the sea, shore, and clouds. <br/> <br/>And is that really a seaplane taxiing towards us ??<br/> <br/>the only problem is that (on my monitor at least) I get an ovewrwhelming sense of darkness which takes out much of the positive impact.<br/> <br/>Maybe a tighter crop losing some of the dark water at the bottom ?</td>', 'nice textures in the sea, shore, and clouds.  And is that really a seaplane taxiing towards us ?? the only problem is that (on my monitor at least) I get an ovewrwhelming sense of darkness which takes out much of the positive impact. Maybe a tighter crop losing some of the dark water at the bottom ?', '2007-11-06 15:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
