(4225670, 601928, 68586, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous picture.<br/> <br/>It took me a while to figure out what I was looking at as it was like looking into some sort of eye. But in a sense it is almost looking out of an ''eye'' into a world beyond. <br/> <br/>There''s a whole dynamic tension here generated between the technology surrounding the viewer and the timeless face of the earth below. This could be a spacecraft taking pictures of Mars or any other distant arrid world. <br/> <br/>This gives the viewer a portal to a quite different place.<br/> <br/>Great shot - completely different.</td>', 'What a fabulous picture. It took me a while to figure out what I was looking at as it was like looking into some sort of eye. But in a sense it is almost looking out of an ''eye'' into a world beyond.  There''s a whole dynamic tension here generated between the technology surrounding the viewer and the timeless face of the earth below. This could be a spacecraft taking pictures of Mars or any other distant arrid world.  This gives the viewer a portal to a quite different place. Great shot - completely different.', '2007-11-06 16:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4225671, 603675, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - good title.</td>', 'Nice shot - good title.', '2007-11-06 16:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
