(4226648, 601134, 54446, '<td valign="top">Really good, except for the horizon tilt.  All the water would rush to the left, if your image were to be taken at face value.  This is a tragic and fatal mistake in landscape photography.  You may hate me for saying this.  But, had you adjusted the horizon squareness, you would have a spectacular image.</td>', 'Really good, except for the horizon tilt.  All the water would rush to the left, if your image were to be taken at face value.  This is a tragic and fatal mistake in landscape photography.  You may hate me for saying this.  But, had you adjusted the horizon squareness, you would have a spectacular image.', '2007-11-06 22:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
