(4226850, 600807, 31403, '<td valign="top">cool in a major way - I''m not voting, but I thought you should know, this transcends the mob mentality of this place.  I hope it''s being well received, but I''m willing to bet differently.<br/> <br/>This makes one stop, and think.  I love that.  This is great work, thank you for making DPC a more diverse place.  We SO need more of this!</td>', 'cool in a major way - I''m not voting, but I thought you should know, this transcends the mob mentality of this place.  I hope it''s being well received, but I''m willing to bet differently. This makes one stop, and think.  I love that.  This is great work, thank you for making DPC a more diverse place.  We SO need more of this!', '2007-11-07 00:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4226915, 600198, 31403, '<td valign="top">stunning and technically beyond my comprehension.  I understand you have to track opposite the earth''s rotation to shoot these?  And look how sharp the stars are.  This is so far beyond what most here will even understand (me included) I doubt it''s being received well.  But I wanted to let you know I appreciate it.  Your work makes me want to go there.  :-)<br/> <br/>Thanks for submitting something different.  I''m better for having seen your entry.</td>', 'stunning and technically beyond my comprehension.  I understand you have to track opposite the earth''s rotation to shoot these?  And look how sharp the stars are.  This is so far beyond what most here will even understand (me included) I doubt it''s being received well.  But I wanted to let you know I appreciate it.  Your work makes me want to go there.  :-) Thanks for submitting something different.  I''m better for having seen your entry.', '2007-11-07 00:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
