(4228485, 606150, 60195, '<td valign="top">My pick for the Blue.  This is absolutely fantastic - must be the still shot for the Ad campaign... it has PRO written all over it.  Whatever they''re paying you, it''s not enough. Hopefully enough voters take the time to get to this shot (certainly slow going).  If it doesn''t win, it''s only because not enough people saw it.  Well done.</td>', 'My pick for the Blue.  This is absolutely fantastic - must be the still shot for the Ad campaign... it has PRO written all over it.  Whatever they''re paying you, it''s not enough. Hopefully enough voters take the time to get to this shot (certainly slow going).  If it doesn''t win, it''s only because not enough people saw it.  Well done.', '2007-11-07 11:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
