(4228630, 600556, 68586, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo but I find the bright pink of her top just too bright and distracting - it keeps pulling the eye away from her face. If it deliberately emphasised her chest that would be fine - but for me it just distracts.<br/> <br/>Lose the pink and suddenly you are looking in her eyes again</td>', 'Very interesting photo but I find the bright pink of her top just too bright and distracting - it keeps pulling the eye away from her face. If it deliberately emphasised her chest that would be fine - but for me it just distracts. Lose the pink and suddenly you are looking in her eyes again', '2007-11-07 12:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
