(4228635, 596758, 68586, '<td valign="top">Love the effect of the sails in the mist - but the sea looks too lurid for my taste  :-  )  It may also benefit from a slightly tighter crop on the right.</td>', 'Love the effect of the sails in the mist - but the sea looks too lurid for my taste  :-  )  It may also benefit from a slightly tighter crop on the right.', '2007-11-07 12:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
