(4228653, 602492, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. Great framing with the tree and wonderful crepuscular rays.<br/> <br/>My only real nitpick is how bright the deer is when the sun is clearly striking the far side of him, and indeed under his chin the left side of his neck (the sunny side) appears darker than what should be the shady side - but that''s a small price for such a lovely photo.<br/> <br/>:-  )</td>', 'Lovely shot. Great framing with the tree and wonderful crepuscular rays. My only real nitpick is how bright the deer is when the sun is clearly striking the far side of him, and indeed under his chin the left side of his neck (the sunny side) appears darker than what should be the shady side - but that''s a small price for such a lovely photo. :-  )', '2007-11-07 12:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4228657, 603018, 67723, '<td valign="top">I hate the post processing if that''s what made this photo look lik this</td>', 'I hate the post processing if that''s what made this photo look lik this', '2007-11-07 12:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4228661, 606467, 67723, '<td valign="top">this would look good in HDR</td>', 'this would look good in HDR', '2007-11-07 13:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4228664, 606806, 68586, '<td valign="top">What a curious photo . . .she has one hand missing, one half missing, there is no eye contact with the viewer or clear explanation of what she is doing, unyet, unyet . . <br/> <br/>Great T-shirt choice both for the blending in to the background, and for the black pattern/writing standing out as a contrast, Fabulous hair colour and definition and great skin tones. Love the crop and positioning.<br/> <br/>I''m really not sure why this works - but for me it works really well.<br/> <br/>Great shot.</td>', 'What a curious photo . . .she has one hand missing, one half missing, there is no eye contact with the viewer or clear explanation of what she is doing, unyet, unyet . .  Great T-shirt choice both for the blending in to the background, and for the black pattern/writing standing out as a contrast, Fabulous hair colour and definition and great skin tones. Love the crop and positioning. I''m really not sure why this works - but for me it works really well. Great shot.', '2007-11-07 13:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4228667, 606579, 67723, '<td valign="top">too bad the sky is blown out. It really serves as a distraction to the image</td>', 'too bad the sky is blown out. It really serves as a distraction to the image', '2007-11-07 13:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
