(4229947, 605609, 50695, '<td valign="top">I get the strangest effect from this picture. I can''t look at it all at once. My gaze immediately goes to the bald man, but then his head disappears into the wall and my gaze shoots over to the woman. It''s as if they can''t really be in the same picture at the same time. Only after a lot of work am I able to pull back and look at the whole picture, and even then only for a moment. But even though I cannot see the whole, I do enjoy the details.</td>', 'I get the strangest effect from this picture. I can''t look at it all at once. My gaze immediately goes to the bald man, but then his head disappears into the wall and my gaze shoots over to the woman. It''s as if they can''t really be in the same picture at the same time. Only after a lot of work am I able to pull back and look at the whole picture, and even then only for a moment. But even though I cannot see the whole, I do enjoy the details.', '2007-11-07 20:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
