(4230757, 604176, 47205, '<td valign="top">This was my fav of the whole Free Study. The lighting is spot on my friend and I am jealous you have Yosemite in <b>"your"</b> backyard. Congrats Mark on another awesome shot!!!</td>', 'This was my fav of the whole Free Study. The lighting is spot on my friend and I am jealous you have Yosemite in "your" backyard. Congrats Mark on another awesome shot!!!', '2007-11-08 00:18:56.000000', NULL, 0),
