(4230769, 607425, 23002, '<td valign="top">Poor little guy.  it does sort of seem dreamy, in a nightmare kind of way.  Cool processing....well seen.</td>', 'Poor little guy.  it does sort of seem dreamy, in a nightmare kind of way.  Cool processing....well seen.', '2007-11-08 00:21:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4230773, 606918, 81342, '<td valign="top">well.. i am thinking a lot of people here are out of their minds. I spent a bit of time planning this picture and although I wasnt expecting to win I really didnt think it deserved to place below some of the other pictures on this contest. there is certainly something fishy going on with the voting on this site. 520 entries and only 115 votes and 154 views.  oh well.</td>', 'well.. i am thinking a lot of people here are out of their minds. I spent a bit of time planning this picture and although I wasnt expecting to win I really didnt think it deserved to place below some of the other pictures on this contest. there is certainly something fishy going on with the voting on this site. 520 entries and only 115 votes and 154 views.  oh well.', '2007-11-08 00:22:59.000000', NULL, 0),
