(4230788, 607103, 23002, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot of a Black Capped Chickadee. :)  great out of focus background.  Nice sharpness.  I know it can be difficult to get catchlights in those beady little eyes.</td>', 'Very nice shot of a Black Capped Chickadee. :)  great out of focus background.  Nice sharpness.  I know it can be difficult to get catchlights in those beady little eyes.', '2007-11-08 00:25:38.000000', NULL, 0),
