(4230807, 604926, 5112, '<td valign="top">Oh, my, you''re loosing your touch.  Nothing funny about this image.  Actually, this is very beautiful to look at, pink moon and all.  It looks more than real, the rockface glows so much.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Oh, my, you''re loosing your touch.  Nothing funny about this image.  Actually, this is very beautiful to look at, pink moon and all.  It looks more than real, the rockface glows so much.  Beautiful.', '2007-11-08 00:31:18.000000', NULL, 0),
