(4230875, 607426, 23002, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I think it would have done better if the rocks were not blurred, it shows that the camera might have moved during the exposure.  Sharpness is next to godliness here at dpc. :)</td>', 'I like it, but I think it would have done better if the rocks were not blurred, it shows that the camera might have moved during the exposure.  Sharpness is next to godliness here at dpc. :)', '2007-11-08 00:57:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4230876, 599466, 16241, '<td valign="top">cant believe this crap score. bah</td>', 'cant believe this crap score. bah', '2007-11-08 00:57:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4230879, 602492, 53316, '<td valign="top">Richmond park, England, huh?  Are you sure you didn''t go to some sort of alternate fairy-land dimention to take this?  This is BREATHTAKING!</td>', 'Richmond park, England, huh?  Are you sure you didn''t go to some sort of alternate fairy-land dimention to take this?  This is BREATHTAKING!', '2007-11-08 00:58:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4230880, 607462, 67152, '<td valign="top">Shannon - I doubt there are many photogs on DPC that could pull of this good of a score with a shot of Disneyworld.  It is an excellent shot - perfectly composed and framed and lit so well.  I really think the subject matter made the voters a bit too grumpy, saying..."really good image, but its Disney World! it must be voted down!"</td>', 'Shannon - I doubt there are many photogs on DPC that could pull of this good of a score with a shot of Disneyworld.  It is an excellent shot - perfectly composed and framed and lit so well.  I really think the subject matter made the voters a bit too grumpy, saying..."really good image, but its Disney World! it must be voted down!"', '2007-11-08 00:58:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4230888, 601928, 8891, '<td valign="top">Big congrats on your Top Ten finish, Cory! Great shot. Marvelous perspective and patterns.</td>', 'Big congrats on your Top Ten finish, Cory! Great shot. Marvelous perspective and patterns.', '2007-11-08 01:02:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4230889, 606486, 78132, '<td valign="top">That''s a ten to me....what an amazing picture! I love the colors....</td>', 'That''s a ten to me....what an amazing picture! I love the colors....', '2007-11-08 01:02:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4230890, 605019, 67152, '<td valign="top">Steve - Well, I think it was a bold choice to enter an on purpose soft focus image in a free study and you seem to have scored pretty well.  My guess is that the saturation (as others commented on) just overwhelmed people.  I think you have a great image for a print here - the colors and softness will really translate well to the printed media.</td>', 'Steve - Well, I think it was a bold choice to enter an on purpose soft focus image in a free study and you seem to have scored pretty well.  My guess is that the saturation (as others commented on) just overwhelmed people.  I think you have a great image for a print here - the colors and softness will really translate well to the printed media.', '2007-11-08 01:02:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4230893, 605649, 78132, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful image!</td>', 'Simply beautiful image!', '2007-11-08 01:03:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4230894, 600891, 67152, '<td valign="top">Dang it Tim!  You are too cool for school.  i loved this one during voting (was one of your 9s).</td>', 'Dang it Tim!  You are too cool for school.  i loved this one during voting (was one of your 9s).', '2007-11-08 01:03:58.000000', NULL, 0),
