(4231067, 607118, 43073, '<td valign="top">She looks so peaceful, lying in the grass, calm, I love the grass here, otherwise she would be floating, unreal, unattached, fake, but here she is anchored, holding tight to this place we can only escape not with magic, but with science. We can''t really levitate, we can''t really fly, and you''ve not tried to tell us she is doing either, she''s just lying there, happy, blue sky overhead, eyes closed, content. That''s the biggest word that comes to mind for me here; content. Lovely image lovingly presented.</td>', 'She looks so peaceful, lying in the grass, calm, I love the grass here, otherwise she would be floating, unreal, unattached, fake, but here she is anchored, holding tight to this place we can only escape not with magic, but with science. We can''t really levitate, we can''t really fly, and you''ve not tried to tell us she is doing either, she''s just lying there, happy, blue sky overhead, eyes closed, content. That''s the biggest word that comes to mind for me here; content. Lovely image lovingly presented.', '2007-11-08 02:39:50.000000', NULL, 0),
