(4231177, 606919, 28742, '<td valign="top">This is a good portrait, Deb. Just suffers mostly from the nearly 600 entries in a FS. Middle of the pack and 5.7+ is very good though. If I was to change anything just for a higher score, I would go for tmore of that darker, grunge / Lucis Art look - more depth in the wrinkle on the face. One other observation is that his expression does not help the photo - it looks somewhere between curious and an angry "WTF?". <br/> <br/>Hope that was helpful.</td>', 'This is a good portrait, Deb. Just suffers mostly from the nearly 600 entries in a FS. Middle of the pack and 5.7+ is very good though. If I was to change anything just for a higher score, I would go for tmore of that darker, grunge / Lucis Art look - more depth in the wrinkle on the face. One other observation is that his expression does not help the photo - it looks somewhere between curious and an angry "WTF?".  Hope that was helpful.', '2007-11-08 04:40:04.000000', NULL, 0),
