(4231822, 600807, 10390, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments.. I expected a resault in this way, but most of all I''m happy and thankful for the comments...<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by digitalknight:</b></div><hr/><i> You got the DK blue with this one for sure.  <br/> <br/>Excellent work.  The best in the challenge in lots of ways<br/> <br/>On this one I''m not reading your notes - it already means stuff to me, that''s enough.  I wonder if it''s the same as it means to you.  Hmmmm - </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for your DK blue and your comments..:-) I cannot say what it means for you but for me it''s pretty deep and the meaning is dark. Maybe you can see something in the long title that I was going to use first? With this image I''m expressing questions because sometimes I can''t understand where all the evilness in some people really comes from, is it in the genes or how people are "molded" while growing up, is this bad behaviour, in that way,  a "pre-wired" part in some people? I had written a very, very long explanation but when I entered it in the challenge... hmmm don''t really know if it fits here..<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-08 10:54:12.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments.. I expected a resault in this way, but most of all I''m happy and thankful for the comments... Originally posted by digitalknight: You got the DK blue with this one for sure.   Excellent work.  The best in the challenge in lots of ways On this one I''m not reading your notes - it already means stuff to me, that''s enough.  I wonder if it''s the same as it means to you.  Hmmmm -   Thanks for your DK blue and your comments..:-) I cannot say what it means for you but for me it''s pretty deep and the meaning is dark. Maybe you can see something in the long title that I was going to use first? With this image I''m expressing questions because sometimes I can''t understand where all the evilness in some people really comes from, is it in the genes or how people are "molded" while growing up, is this bad behaviour, in that way,  a "pre-wired" part in some people? I had written a very, very long explanation but when I entered it in the challenge... hmmm don''t really know if it fits here..', '2007-11-08 10:49:03.000000', '2007-11-08 10:54:12.000000', 0),
