(4233174, 606766, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very underrated. Very cute idea and nicely setup. I think a little bit more of PP could''ve been applied to enchance the puppy''s eyes. Maybe some dodging to bring them out and then sharpening up of the dog''s face. I can see the eyes pretty well , though a little too dark here. It might''ve looked all too dark on many screens out there, so the lower votes?</td>', 'Very underrated. Very cute idea and nicely setup. I think a little bit more of PP could''ve been applied to enchance the puppy''s eyes. Maybe some dodging to bring them out and then sharpening up of the dog''s face. I can see the eyes pretty well , though a little too dark here. It might''ve looked all too dark on many screens out there, so the lower votes?', '2007-11-08 18:23:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4233189, 606348, 29011, '<td valign="top">It''s a yummy and great looking shot. I hoped it''d place better. In the sea of great shots posted in the challenge this easily made my top50. I didn''t guess that this was yours though. You tricked me ;)</td>', 'It''s a yummy and great looking shot. I hoped it''d place better. In the sea of great shots posted in the challenge this easily made my top50. I didn''t guess that this was yours though. You tricked me ;)', '2007-11-08 18:31:16.000000', NULL, 0),
