(4233203, 599466, 29011, '<td valign="top">You and me Lesley(Goodman). The lighting and expression is perfect. Perhaps the bottom part pose is a little too static but maybe if there was a crisp white executive style shirt instead of the blouse here , it would add to the mood better?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-12 23:36:34.</i></td>', 'You and me Lesley(Goodman). The lighting and expression is perfect. Perhaps the bottom part pose is a little too static but maybe if there was a crisp white executive style shirt instead of the blouse here , it would add to the mood better?', '2007-11-08 18:39:50.000000', '2007-11-12 23:36:34.000000', 0),
(4233218, 606711, 29011, '<td valign="top">So glad you had a great time during the shoot. Thanks for sharing the story. The pose really makes the shot. Does look like a dream. Only nitpick is the bottom right looks too hot on my screen.</td>', 'So glad you had a great time during the shoot. Thanks for sharing the story. The pose really makes the shot. Does look like a dream. Only nitpick is the bottom right looks too hot on my screen.', '2007-11-08 18:49:54.000000', NULL, 0),
