(4233972, 606603, 81382, '<td valign="top">Wow, thanks for information. The difference between the original and the finished article is incredible. This image caught my eye because it almost looks like computer graphics, like one of those nVidia technical demos released with each new generation of graphics cards</td>', 'Wow, thanks for information. The difference between the original and the finished article is incredible. This image caught my eye because it almost looks like computer graphics, like one of those nVidia technical demos released with each new generation of graphics cards', '2007-11-09 02:56:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4233981, 602492, 67145, '<td valign="top">congratulations mark on this amazing photograph and process .. and congratulation on a new pb .. i reckon this one will be pretty difficult to beat .. altho looking at the quality of your work it will only be a matter of time .. :)<br/>i''m sure a lot of ''better halves'' would have to put up with very similar behaviour from their dpc maniacs .. your story sounds very similar to mine .. well the "come here and tell me which photo I should enter" sort''v comment .. <br/>i think to beat the site record would involve a most brilliant photograph, the correct challenge and a lot of luck .. those voters are a very fickle lot .. all the best .. you certainly have the talent, imagination and obsessive nature to do it !!!!!.. :)<br/></td>', 'congratulations mark on this amazing photograph and process .. and congratulation on a new pb .. i reckon this one will be pretty difficult to beat .. altho looking at the quality of your work it will only be a matter of time .. :)i''m sure a lot of ''better halves'' would have to put up with very similar behaviour from their dpc maniacs .. your story sounds very similar to mine .. well the "come here and tell me which photo I should enter" sort''v comment .. i think to beat the site record would involve a most brilliant photograph, the correct challenge and a lot of luck .. those voters are a very fickle lot .. all the best .. you certainly have the talent, imagination and obsessive nature to do it !!!!!.. :)', '2007-11-09 03:21:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4233982, 607405, 79657, '<td valign="top">Great portrait Jon, just love the DOF and the background color. I agree that the eyes aren''t really sharp. The shadow on her left cheek is a little bit too strong. I love blue eyes... I wish I have one...</td>', 'Great portrait Jon, just love the DOF and the background color. I agree that the eyes aren''t really sharp. The shadow on her left cheek is a little bit too strong. I love blue eyes... I wish I have one...', '2007-11-09 03:22:49.000000', NULL, 0),
