(4234020, 602778, 27482, '<td valign="top">Damn, another ribbon!  I would gladly change places with you in the free study marathon in exchange for those ribbons you have gotten in the free studies this year :)  DON´T keep it up man!  :)</td>', 'Damn, another ribbon!  I would gladly change places with you in the free study marathon in exchange for those ribbons you have gotten in the free studies this year :)  DON´T keep it up man!  :)', '2007-11-09 04:32:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4234024, 604176, 82032, '<td valign="top">wow. beautiful scene</td>', 'wow. beautiful scene', '2007-11-09 05:03:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4234037, 602492, 34938, '<td valign="top">OK Mark...I got the wrong photographer, but the place was right! My brother used to live in Richmond Hill. This is sensational. Congratulations on the blue</td>', 'OK Mark...I got the wrong photographer, but the place was right! My brother used to live in Richmond Hill. This is sensational. Congratulations on the blue', '2007-11-09 05:43:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4234040, 605044, 68035, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot.  SO much to love about it<br/> <br/>The gentle B&amp;W<br/>The composition<br/>The way the girls eyes are staring directly at the camera/viewer and are just the right side of the swing chain<br/>The lighting on her hair and the way it is blowing<br/>The tall plants in the background which almost dwarf the child<br/> <br/>5.6 is good for a FS, I get the feeling that if you had had a specific challenge that this shot would have fitted it would have definietly been 6+<br/> <br/>Lovely</td>', 'I really liked this shot.  SO much to love about it The gentle B&WThe compositionThe way the girls eyes are staring directly at the camera/viewer and are just the right side of the swing chainThe lighting on her hair and the way it is blowingThe tall plants in the background which almost dwarf the child 5.6 is good for a FS, I get the feeling that if you had had a specific challenge that this shot would have fitted it would have definietly been 6+ Lovely', '2007-11-09 05:49:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4234041, 604976, 68035, '<td valign="top">Peter<br/> <br/>Nice finish in a fs considering that the subject is quite ''ordinary'' which I guess is a testament to how strong your technicals were<br/> <br/>Love the fact that the leaves on some trees are yellow not red which compliments the lines on the road and is nicely set off by the tarmac</td>', 'Peter Nice finish in a fs considering that the subject is quite ''ordinary'' which I guess is a testament to how strong your technicals were Love the fact that the leaves on some trees are yellow not red which compliments the lines on the road and is nicely set off by the tarmac', '2007-11-09 05:52:06.000000', NULL, 0);
