(4235143, 604820, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a big fan of car or tractor shots because i guess I do not get any kind of emotional tug from them.  What I love about this tho is that you actually made it look like the tractor is stepping towards you as if to pose.  That is pretty cool to me and makes this one look different from the rest.</td>', 'I''m not really a big fan of car or tractor shots because i guess I do not get any kind of emotional tug from them.  What I love about this tho is that you actually made it look like the tractor is stepping towards you as if to pose.  That is pretty cool to me and makes this one look different from the rest.', '2007-11-09 15:45:15.000000', NULL, 0),
