(4235326, 606768, 29011, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the new PB. Glad this one made a 6. I really like the shot. What I think would''ve helped the score is some different sharpening technique. The shot looks jaggy in some places. Maybe the jpg was resaved many times over and/or with high compression?</td>', 'Congratulations on the new PB. Glad this one made a 6. I really like the shot. What I think would''ve helped the score is some different sharpening technique. The shot looks jaggy in some places. Maybe the jpg was resaved many times over and/or with high compression?', '2007-11-09 17:16:19.000000', NULL, 0),
