(4235736, 607316, 45631, '<td valign="top">A portrait shot always looks nicer if the person pops in the photo.  To do this you need to bring her further forward of the green foliage and use a larger aperture.  This will create background bokeh and make the person the strong focal point in the image (you probably already know this so sorry if I''m just repeating).  Cheers</td>', 'A portrait shot always looks nicer if the person pops in the photo.  To do this you need to bring her further forward of the green foliage and use a larger aperture.  This will create background bokeh and make the person the strong focal point in the image (you probably already know this so sorry if I''m just repeating).  Cheers', '2007-11-09 20:58:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4235812, 601939, 67841, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - congrats!</td>', 'Beautiful shot - congrats!', '2007-11-09 21:58:45.000000', NULL, 0),
