(4236034, 604820, 66384, '<td valign="top">What a hoot! I never would have guessed it was your. The subject looks more like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=63398" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">NikonJeb</a>''s style. The processing is very interesting. This was a really good study.</td>', 'What a hoot! I never would have guessed it was your. The subject looks more like  NikonJeb''s style. The processing is very interesting. This was a really good study.', '2007-11-09 23:34:16.000000', NULL, 0),
