(4236063, 606919, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very interesting character. I really like the crop. And I like his eyes the way they are. I keep trying to see into them, and I can''t. It makes me wonder what he is seeing. I''m also curious to know what you did in the processing.</td>', 'Very interesting character. I really like the crop. And I like his eyes the way they are. I keep trying to see into them, and I can''t. It makes me wonder what he is seeing. I''m also curious to know what you did in the processing.', '2007-11-09 23:47:32.000000', NULL, 0),
