(4236115, 604547, 86410, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene, but I think I would have cropped out a bit more of the left, to take the tree more out of center and to reduce some of the white that pulls you away from the tree.  I like the darkness, and I love the angle of the fence!</td>', 'Beautiful scene, but I think I would have cropped out a bit more of the left, to take the tree more out of center and to reduce some of the white that pulls you away from the tree.  I like the darkness, and I love the angle of the fence!', '2007-11-10 00:02:02.000000', NULL, 0),
