(4236147, 607243, 66384, '<td valign="top">I didn''t make it all the way through the 520 entries during voting. I wish I had seen this one, because I would have helped you score a bit. I really like it. Usually I''m not fond of blurry water, but in this case it creates a wonderful composition. I love the blues and grays and the little tinge of gold/orange in the water. The image has great motion and light.</td>', 'I didn''t make it all the way through the 520 entries during voting. I wish I had seen this one, because I would have helped you score a bit. I really like it. Usually I''m not fond of blurry water, but in this case it creates a wonderful composition. I love the blues and grays and the little tinge of gold/orange in the water. The image has great motion and light.', '2007-11-10 00:10:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4236156, 604256, 86410, '<td valign="top">A fun shot!</td>', 'A fun shot!', '2007-11-10 00:12:32.000000', NULL, 0),
