(4236640, 606711, 68035, '<td valign="top">Woohoo a shot that gives all of us mortal photographers hope at DPC.<br/> <br/>Its a great image and I love the leading line created by her veil together with the counterpointing of the backdrop and the girl<br/> <br/>Its a top shot...<br/> <br/>And yet it ''only'' scores 5.7795.<br/> <br/>Voters, who understands ''em?<br/> <br/>Mind you I bet you would take that 5.7 because of the great fun that you had taking the shot rather than a 6+ for a studio one everytime</td>', 'Woohoo a shot that gives all of us mortal photographers hope at DPC. Its a great image and I love the leading line created by her veil together with the counterpointing of the backdrop and the girl Its a top shot... And yet it ''only'' scores 5.7795. Voters, who understands ''em? Mind you I bet you would take that 5.7 because of the great fun that you had taking the shot rather than a 6+ for a studio one everytime', '2007-11-10 08:40:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4236735, 606137, 40376, '<td valign="top">Sorry to have missed this 1st time around and yes, suprised to see it didnt score higher as it''s a remarkable shot - the expression on the face is so serene !<br/>Great shot.</td>', 'Sorry to have missed this 1st time around and yes, suprised to see it didnt score higher as it''s a remarkable shot - the expression on the face is so serene !Great shot.', '2007-11-10 09:33:48.000000', NULL, 0),
