(4237899, 605429, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well what do you know!  I was about to go look through the challenge to find this, and all I had to do was check Team Suck results.  For what it''s worth, this is a DebTopTen (I''m thinking of having that patented..).  Not as good as a Posthumous Blue, but I thought this was a superb shot.  ''Grats on the 6+ score with it, too.</td>', 'Well what do you know!  I was about to go look through the challenge to find this, and all I had to do was check Team Suck results.  For what it''s worth, this is a DebTopTen (I''m thinking of having that patented..).  Not as good as a Posthumous Blue, but I thought this was a superb shot.  ''Grats on the 6+ score with it, too.', '2007-11-10 22:40:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4237905, 607093, 30982, '<td valign="top">I find it interesting when people point out post processing "errors" that for some reason I never see.  This could explain a lot about why I don''t quite sync with DPC... I kinda like subjects and light.  Silly me.  Nice subject here - wouldn''t be as nice without the birds, either.  Something about bringing life to the structure.  That and birds tend to like steeples and such.  Nice places to hang out up until the bells start chiming, I would guess.</td>', 'I find it interesting when people point out post processing "errors" that for some reason I never see.  This could explain a lot about why I don''t quite sync with DPC... I kinda like subjects and light.  Silly me.  Nice subject here - wouldn''t be as nice without the birds, either.  Something about bringing life to the structure.  That and birds tend to like steeples and such.  Nice places to hang out up until the bells start chiming, I would guess.', '2007-11-10 22:43:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4237915, 607037, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is my kinda shot.  I like shooting odd things like this and I have a thing for concertina wire (especially down here - there is quite an abundance of the stuff!)  Not something that will do well in a Free Study due to limited audience appeal.  It''s not a sunset or a pretty girl, and it doesn''t have a main, easily defined "subject".  The comment regarding lack of depth has some merit as far as this particular composition is concerned - and of course you could always dress it up a bit with vignettes, dodging, burning etc.  Or you could acidize it or grunge it.  Or you could leave it as is and be pleased with what you saw and captured, and understand that it won''t appeal to the masses - but that it''s a good shot just the same!</td>', 'This is my kinda shot.  I like shooting odd things like this and I have a thing for concertina wire (especially down here - there is quite an abundance of the stuff!)  Not something that will do well in a Free Study due to limited audience appeal.  It''s not a sunset or a pretty girl, and it doesn''t have a main, easily defined "subject".  The comment regarding lack of depth has some merit as far as this particular composition is concerned - and of course you could always dress it up a bit with vignettes, dodging, burning etc.  Or you could acidize it or grunge it.  Or you could leave it as is and be pleased with what you saw and captured, and understand that it won''t appeal to the masses - but that it''s a good shot just the same!', '2007-11-10 22:50:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4237928, 606136, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love that it''s full color.  Stark and beautiful.</td>', 'I love that it''s full color.  Stark and beautiful.', '2007-11-10 22:54:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4237936, 607409, 30982, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a very fun and engaging shot - I like how she''s looking one way, the dog another, AND she''s on the phone at the same time.  Nice capture, well composed.</td>', 'I thought this was a very fun and engaging shot - I like how she''s looking one way, the dog another, AND she''s on the phone at the same time.  Nice capture, well composed.', '2007-11-10 22:57:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4237942, 607171, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''ll agree with your assessment that this does seem like a snapshot, but I can also see why you took it.  As an avid reader, and one who worries that the artform of reading is losing out to video games and such, I find this a compelling sight.  As a photograph, maybe it needs more context (which I prefer), or less (for DPC purposes).  I do like your choice to "gray" out the background a bit - I''ve been trying that lately as well.</td>', 'I''ll agree with your assessment that this does seem like a snapshot, but I can also see why you took it.  As an avid reader, and one who worries that the artform of reading is losing out to video games and such, I find this a compelling sight.  As a photograph, maybe it needs more context (which I prefer), or less (for DPC purposes).  I do like your choice to "gray" out the background a bit - I''ve been trying that lately as well.', '2007-11-10 23:00:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4237952, 603564, 30982, '<td valign="top">A perfect 6!  (Well, it works in some sports...)  Lovely view, and I love how the bridge disappears into the distance.</td>', 'A perfect 6!  (Well, it works in some sports...)  Lovely view, and I love how the bridge disappears into the distance.', '2007-11-10 23:02:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4237961, 607335, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like a very lovely place to spend an afternoon - and it has water, which to me is a very nice sight these days!  The overcast/bright sky hurts this a bit - and yes, I realize that the sky is what you get when you''re there - I have that same problem a lot!</td>', 'Looks like a very lovely place to spend an afternoon - and it has water, which to me is a very nice sight these days!  The overcast/bright sky hurts this a bit - and yes, I realize that the sky is what you get when you''re there - I have that same problem a lot!', '2007-11-10 23:06:38.000000', NULL, 0),
