(4237981, 600618, 30982, '<td valign="top">This scored a lot lower than I thought it would.  It''s a very strong shot as far as having something to say, but it''s not "pretty" and probably made some feel uncomfortable.  And I don''t think that''s a bad thing.  Technicals did hurt it a bit, too, I suspect - b&amp;w is perfect for it, but it does seem over-sharpened in places.</td>', 'This scored a lot lower than I thought it would.  It''s a very strong shot as far as having something to say, but it''s not "pretty" and probably made some feel uncomfortable.  And I don''t think that''s a bad thing.  Technicals did hurt it a bit, too, I suspect - b&w is perfect for it, but it does seem over-sharpened in places.', '2007-11-10 23:12:08.000000', NULL, 0),
