(4369538, 607126, 63267, '<td valign="top">I think that the processing on this image really enhances the overall feel.  I like the old look of this old steamer and the soft colors make it all feel nostalgic.  The tonemapping did a wonderful job, the only thing I would suggest is to add a little bit of softlight in order to boost the contrast a little bit.  I think that this little amount of contrast boost will really make this image POP!  I can only imagine that if this wasn''t in a free study challenge that it would have scored higher.  Despite that, it is still a fascinating image and one to be proud of.  I bet it would even look delightful on canvas, maybe even mounted in a electric train set room for the conductor to enjoy!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-07 11:20:49.</i></td>', 'I think that the processing on this image really enhances the overall feel.  I like the old look of this old steamer and the soft colors make it all feel nostalgic.  The tonemapping did a wonderful job, the only thing I would suggest is to add a little bit of softlight in order to boost the contrast a little bit.  I think that this little amount of contrast boost will really make this image POP!  I can only imagine that if this wasn''t in a free study challenge that it would have scored higher.  Despite that, it is still a fascinating image and one to be proud of.  I bet it would even look delightful on canvas, maybe even mounted in a electric train set room for the conductor to enjoy!', '2008-01-07 11:19:22.000000', '2008-01-07 11:20:49.000000', 0),
