(4551440, 600479, 90394, '<td valign="top">Wow... absolutely gorgeous. Technicals, impact and composition all in one. If I had voted, this is an easy 10.1. That has to be the most amazing sun I''ve seen (in a photo), and the clouds in front of it... this is just a spellbinding capture. I''m really glad you were there to get this - who knows what we''d have got from an unskilled photographer. Seriously - I can''t stop looking at this. I guess I''ll have to buy a print!</td>', 'Wow... absolutely gorgeous. Technicals, impact and composition all in one. If I had voted, this is an easy 10.1. That has to be the most amazing sun I''ve seen (in a photo), and the clouds in front of it... this is just a spellbinding capture. I''m really glad you were there to get this - who knows what we''d have got from an unskilled photographer. Seriously - I can''t stop looking at this. I guess I''ll have to buy a print!', '2008-03-10 05:22:30.000000', NULL, 0),
